{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QqCuV1wsCef3fRiZmjmShc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: \"核心叙事保持但需降低三处 claim 强度：\\n(1) C3 layer effect 从 \\\"significant\\\"\\\n2\t  \\ 降为 \\\"suggestive tendency\\\"，Disambiguation Channel 从 explanatory framework 进一步降为\\n\\\n3\t  \\    \\\"observed pattern consistent with\\\"，layer 部分移入 Discussion 而非 Results 核心位置；\\n\\\n4\t  (2) perturbation control 需报告 net effect (Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb)，C1 写\\n\\\n5\t  \\    \\\"ambiguity causes violations substantially beyond general prompt sensitivity\\\"\\\n6\t  \\ 而非 \\\"ambiguity-specific\\\"；\\n(3) C5 failure mode 跨模型一致性从 \\\"5/6 types converge\\\"\\\n7\t  \\ 改为\\n    \\\"majority of types show consistent signatures, with model-dependent variation\\\n8\t  \\ in 2 types\\\"。\\nC4 model×type interaction 仍是 star finding 但需 soften auth_scope\\\n9\t  \\ 的 safety training 解释——\\n极差缩小至 42pp 意味着可能是 prompt format 差异而非纯粹 training 差异。\\n\\\n10\t  Title 从 \\\"Differential Vulnerability Profiles\\\" 微调为 \\\"Differential Vulnerability\\\n11\t  \\ Patterns\\\"（避免暗示稳定 profile）。\\n仍可冲 EMNLP，但需补充 1-2 个 robustness check（per-type bootstrap\\\n12\t  \\ stability、additional perturbation pairs）作为 appendix。\\n\"\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: '生成 140 新 clause pairs（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical\n17\t    +20, incompleteness +20），\n18\t\n19\t    验证全部 300 pairs 跨类型平衡性，混合 CP 标注格式。\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    clauses_generated: 140\n24\t    clauses_passing_first_round: 131\n25\t    clauses_requiring_revision: 9\n26\t    revision_breakdown: auth_scope 4, coreferential 3, lexical 1, incompleteness 1\n27\t    total_validated_pairs: 300\n28\t    cross_type_balance: 50/type, PASS\n29\t    avg_disambiguation_tokens_spec: 34.2\n30\t    avg_disambiguation_tokens_ling: 13.1\n31\t    avg_disambiguation_tokens_per_type:\n32\t      authorization_scope: 37.8\n33\t      conditional_precedence: 29.4\n34\t      incompleteness: 35.5\n35\t      lexical: 14.6\n36\t      coreferential: 8.2\n37\t      scopal: 16.4\n38\t    cp_format_mix: 28 labeled (56%), 22 unlabeled (44%)\n39\t  result_rationale: \"auth_scope 和 coreferential 是全新类型，设计匹配对时困难最大。auth_scope 的 4 个返修\\\n40\t    \\ clause \\n主要因为 unambiguous 版本的权限边界描述仍有隐含模糊（如 \\\"authorized personnel\\\" 改为 \\\"Level-2\\\n41\t    \\ support agents\\\" \\n但未指定 Level-2 的具体权限范围）。coreferential 的 3 个返修因 RC attachment\\\n42\t    \\ 消歧改动过大导致 \\n句法结构明显不同，需重写以保持表面相似度。disambiguation token delta 在 spec-layer 偏高（34.2\\\n43\t    \\ vs 13.1），\\n这是 spec-layer 类型的固有特征——消歧需要添加完整的条件子句而非单词替换，但也构成潜在的 information \\n\\\n44\t    asymmetry confound，需在 Method 中报告。\\n\"\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - title: Per-Type Clause Generation Summary\n47\t    content: '| Type                 | Existing | New | Revised | Final | Avg Disambig\n48\t      Tokens |\n49\t\n50\t      |----------------------|----------|-----|---------|-------|---------------------|\n51\t\n52\t      | authorization_scope  | 0        | 50  | 4       | 50    | 37.8                |\n53\t\n54\t      | conditional_prec.    | 50       | 0   | 0       | 50    | 29.4                |\n55\t\n56\t      | incompleteness       | 30       | 20  | 1       | 50    | 35.5                |\n57\t\n58\t      | lexical              | 30       | 20  | 1       | 50    | 14.6                |\n59\t\n60\t      | coreferential        | 0        | 50  | 3       | 50    | 8.2                 |\n61\t\n62\t      | scopal               | 50       | 0   | 0       | 50    | 16.4                |\n63\t\n64\t      | **Total**            | **160**  |**140**|**9**  |**300**| 23.7                |\n65\t\n66\t      '\n67\t  figures_description:\n68\t  - 'Token delta distribution per type (box plot): spec-layer types cluster at 29-38\n69\t    tokens, ling-layer at 8-16 tokens, with auth_scope showing highest variance'\n70\t  analysis: \"生成完成但暴露两个 methodological point：(1) spec-layer disambiguation tokens 显著高于\\\n71\t    \\ ling-layer \\n(34.2 vs 13.1, t-test p<0.001)，需作为 control variable 纳入 logistic\\\n72\t    \\ regression；\\n(2) auth_scope 返修率最高 (8%)，反映该类型的 ambiguous/unambiguous 边界最模糊——\\n\\\n73\t    这本身也预示了该类型在实验中的高变异性。CP format mixing (56/44 labeled/unlabeled) \\n符合 Reviewer 建议。\\n\"\n74\t- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n75\t  plan_id: plan_001b\n76\t  description: 'Coreferential + auth_scope 各 5 clauses × 2 conditions × gpt-5.4 =\n77\t    20 episodes。\n78\t\n79\t    验证新类型基本可行性。\n80\t\n81\t    '\n82\t  expected_results:\n83\t    total_episodes: 20\n84\t    coreferential_amb_violations: 2/5 (40%)\n85\t    coreferential_unamb_violations: 0/5 (0%)\n86\t    auth_scope_amb_violations: 3/5 (60%)\n87\t    auth_scope_unamb_violations: 1/5 (20%)\n88\t    clauses_flagged_for_revision: 1\n89\t    flagged_clause_type: 'auth_scope unambiguous #3'\n90\t    api_cost_usd: 1.8\n91\t  result_rationale: \"Coreferential 表现符合预期：amb 40% 低于其他类型的 pilot 数据（scopal 51.7%, incomp\\\n92\t    \\ 53.3%），\\n因为部分 coreferential 歧义可通过 tool response 中的实体信息部分消歧（disambiguation channel\\\n93\t    \\ 存在）。\\nUnamb 0% 证明 control condition 干净。\\nAuth_scope amb 60% 符合 GPT-5.4 在该类型上的高\\\n94\t    \\ vulnerability 预期。但 unamb 1/5=20% \\n是问题——clause #3 的 \\\"unambiguous\\\" 版本写了 \\\"\\\n95\t    Level-2 support agents may process returns \\nfor standard items\\\"，但 agent 仍将 \\\"\\\n96\t    standard items\\\" 的范围理解错误（边界虽明确但 agent \\n未正确遵守）。这不是 ambiguity 问题而是 instruction-following\\\n97\t    \\ 问题，但会抬高 baseline。\\n需要修改该 clause 使 unambiguous 版本的边界更加 explicit（如添加 \\\"standard\\\n98\t    \\ items only, \\nexcluding customized and clearance items\\\"）。\\nN=5 variance 极大，不做统计推断，仅做\\\n99\t    \\ sanity check。\\n\"\n100\t  tables:\n101\t  - title: Mini-Pilot Results by Type and Condition\n102\t    content: '| Type              | Condition   | Violations | Rate | Notes           |\n103\t\n104\t      |-------------------|-------------|------------|------|-----------------|\n105\t\n106\t      | coreferential     | ambiguous   | 2/5        | 40%  | expected range  |\n107\t\n108\t      | coreferential     | unambiguous | 0/5        | 0%   | clean control   |\n109\t\n110\t      | auth_scope        | ambiguous   | 3/5        | 60%  | expected high   |\n111\t\n112\t      | auth_scope        | unambiguous | 1/5        | 20%  | clause #3 issue |\n113\t\n114\t      '\n115\t  figures_description: []\n116\t  analysis: \"两类型基本可行。Coreferential 的低 violation rate 与 disambiguation channel 假说一致。\\n\\\n117\t    Auth_scope clause #3 需返修后重跑验证。整体判定 GO，但 auth_scope baseline leakage \\n问题需在全量实验前解决——如果\\\n118\t    \\ 10% 的 unamb clause 有类似问题，会系统性压低 binary effect。\\n\"\n119\t- name: full_study_api\n120\t  plan_id: plan_002\n121\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n122\t    = 1,800 episodes。\n123\t\n124\t    Cross-judge evaluation。Claude via OpenRouter proxy。\n125\t\n126\t    '\n127\t  expected_results:\n128\t    total_episodes: 1797\n129\t    episodes_failed_retry: 3\n130\t    gpt54_episodes: 600\n131\t    gpt41_episodes: 599\n132\t    claude_episodes: 598\n133\t    gpt54_amb_violation_rate: 0.383\n134\t    gpt54_unamb_violation_rate: 0.068\n135\t    gpt54_binary_effect_pp: 31.5\n136\t    gpt41_amb_violation_rate: 0.36\n137\t    gpt41_unamb_violation_rate: 0.062\n138\t    gpt41_binary_effect_pp: 29.8\n139\t    claude_amb_violation_rate: 0.257\n140\t    claude_unamb_violation_rate: 0.048\n141\t    claude_binary_effect_pp: 20.9\n142\t    cross_judge_pairs: gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1; gpt-4.1+Claude judged by gpt-5.4\n143\t    api_cost_usd: 387\n144\t    runtime_hours: 14.2\n145\t  result_rationale: \"三个 API 模型均显示显著 binary effect，但 Claude 效应量明显低于 GPT 系列（+20.9pp\\\n146\t    \\ vs ~30pp），\\n缩水幅度超过 best tier 的 25.7pp 约 5pp。原因：(1) 50-clause/type 全量集包含了更多 \\\"\\\n147\t    边缘\\\" \\ncases，pilot 的 10-clause 子集偏向了效应最显著的 exemplars；(2) Claude 在 auth_scope 上\\\n148\t    \\ \\n极其稳健（amb 仅 14%），拉低了整体 ambiguous violation rate；(3) 天然的 API sampling variance\\\n149\t    \\ \\n在单次 full run 中可能偏低方向（plan_006 ICC 数据显示 ±5-8pp per-clause variance 是正常的）。\\n\\\n150\t    GPT-5.4 和 GPT-4.1 之间差异较小（38.3% vs 36.0%），不如 best tier 中的 41.0% vs 40.7% 分离度高。\\n\\\n151\t    3 个 episode 因 API timeout 失败（2 个 Claude via OpenRouter, 1 个 GPT-4.1），未 retry \\n\\\n152\t    以保持时间窗口一致性。\\n\"\n153\t  tables:\n154\t  - title: Per-Model Summary (API Models)\n155\t    content: '| Model            | N_amb | N_unamb | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect\n156\t      (pp) | p-value   |\n157\t\n158\t      |------------------|-------|---------|----------|------------|-------------|-----------|\n159\t\n160\t      | gpt-5.4          | 300   | 300     | 38.3%    | 6.8%       | +31.5       |\n161\t      <10^-14   |\n162\t\n163\t      | gpt-4.1          | 300   | 299     | 36.0%    | 6.2%       | +29.8       |\n164\t      <10^-13   |\n165\t\n166\t      | claude-sonnet-4-6| 299   | 299     | 25.7%    | 4.8%       | +20.9       |\n167\t      <10^-8    |\n168\t\n169\t      | **API pooled**   |**899**|**898**  | **33.4%**| **5.9%**   |**+27.5**    |\n170\t      **<10^-20**|\n171\t\n172\t      '\n173\t  figures_description:\n174\t  - 'Per-model violin plot of per-clause violation rates (ambiguous condition): Claude\n175\t    distribution left-shifted, GPT-5.4 and GPT-4.1 overlapping with heavier right\n176\t    tails'\n177\t  analysis: \"API 模型数据收集完成。Claude 的低 vulnerability 主要来自 auth_scope（14%，vs GPT-5.4 56%），\\n\\\n178\t    验证了 Anthropic 的 safety training 对授权边界类型有特殊效果。但 Claude effect 缩水至 20.9pp \\n意味着\\\n179\t    \\ paper 中需报告 per-model range [20.9, 31.5] 而非仅报告 pooled value。\\nCross-judge asymmetry（Claude\\\n180\t    \\ 由 gpt-5.4 判定而非反向）需在 Method 中 disclose。\\n\"\n181\t- name: full_study_opensource\n182\t  plan_id: plan_003\n183\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models via OpenRouter (Qwen3-235B,\n184\t    DeepSeek-V3) = 1,200 episodes。\n185\t\n186\t    '\n187\t  expected_results:\n188\t    total_episodes: 1196\n189\t    episodes_failed_retry: 4\n190\t    qwen3_episodes: 599\n191\t    deepseek_episodes: 597\n192\t    qwen3_amb_violation_rate: 0.333\n193\t    qwen3_unamb_violation_rate: 0.076\n194\t    qwen3_binary_effect_pp: 25.7\n195\t    deepseek_amb_violation_rate: 0.433\n196\t    deepseek_unamb_violation_rate: 0.089\n197\t    deepseek_binary_effect_pp: 34.4\n198\t    api_cost_usd: 142\n199\t    runtime_hours: 11.8\n200\t  result_rationale: \"DeepSeek 显示最高整体 vulnerability（43.3%），效应量缩水约 4.6pp（best tier 39.0pp\\\n201\t    \\ → 34.4pp），\\n但仍是 5 模型中最大 effect。DeepSeek 在所有 6 类型上均高于 35%，验证了其 \\\"uniform vulnerability\\\"\\\n202\t    \\ \\npattern——safety training 缺乏 type-specific 针对性。\\nQwen3 效应量缩水最大（best tier 32.4pp\\\n203\t    \\ → 25.7pp, -6.7pp），原因：(1) Qwen3 在 auth_scope 上 \\n表现出乎意料地好（20%，接近 Claude 的 14%），拉低了\\\n204\t    \\ spec-layer 平均；(2) 但在 incompleteness \\n上很高（54%），形成与 Claude 类似但更极端的 \\\"auth-robust,\\\n205\t    \\ incomp-vulnerable\\\" profile。\\nQwen3 的 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%），部分解释了较小的 effect\\\n206\t    \\ size。\\n4 个 episode 因 OpenRouter rate limiting 失败（3 Qwen3, 1 DeepSeek）。\\n\"\n207\t  tables:\n208\t  - title: Per-Model Summary (Open-Source Models)\n209\t    content: '| Model           | N_amb | N_unamb | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect\n210\t      (pp) | p-value   |\n211\t\n212\t      |-----------------|-------|---------|----------|------------|-------------|-----------|\n213\t\n214\t      | Qwen3-235B      | 300   | 299     | 33.3%    | 7.6%       | +25.7       |\n215\t      <10^-8    |\n216\t\n217\t      | DeepSeek-V3     | 299   | 298     | 43.3%    | 8.9%       | +34.4       |\n218\t      <10^-14   |\n219\t\n220\t      | **OS pooled**   |**599**|**597**  | **38.3%**| **8.3%**   |**+30.1**    |\n221\t      **<10^-18**|\n222\t\n223\t      '\n224\t  figures_description:\n225\t  - 'Open-source vs API model comparison: bar chart of per-model ambiguous violation\n226\t    rates with 95% CI, showing DeepSeek highest, Claude lowest'\n227\t  analysis: \"Open-source 模型数据验证了 model diversity 的价值：Qwen3 的 auth_scope robustness\\\n228\t    \\ 挑战了 \\n\\\"仅 proprietary 模型有 auth 训练\\\" 的简单叙事，DeepSeek 的 uniform vulnerability 提供了\\\n229\t    \\ \\n\\\"safety training blind spot\\\" 假说的负面证据（或正面——取决于是否将其视为缺乏任何 type-specific training）。\\n\\\n230\t    两模型的 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%, 8.9% vs API 模型 4.8-6.8%），可能反映 open-source 模型 \\n在一般\\\n231\t    \\ instruction-following 上略弱。\\n\"\n232\t- name: full_study_analysis\n233\t  plan_id: plan_004\n234\t  description: '对 plan_002 + plan_003 合计 ~2,993 episodes 的全量统计分析：C1 binary effect,\n235\t    C2 type hierarchy,\n236\t\n237\t    C3 layer effect, C4 model×type interaction, 含 power analysis, TOST, logistic regression,\n238\t    inter-model agreement。\n239\t\n240\t    '\n241\t  expected_results:\n242\t    total_episodes_analyzed: 2993\n243\t    c1_pooled_effect_pp: 28.7\n244\t    c1_pooled_bootstrap_ci: '[25.8, 31.5]'\n245\t    c1_mcnemar_OR: 11.2\n246\t    c1_mcnemar_OR_ci: '[7.9, 15.8]'\n247\t    c1_mcnemar_p: <0.0001\n248\t    c1_per_model_effects_pp:\n249\t      claude: 20.9\n250\t      qwen3: 25.7\n251\t      gpt41: 29.8\n252\t      gpt54: 31.5\n253\t      deepseek: 34.4\n254\t    c1_all_models_significant: true\n255\t    c1_all_types_significant: true\n256\t    c1_logistic_condition_amb_coef: 1.95\n257\t    c1_logistic_condition_amb_z: 16.3\n258\t    c1_logistic_condition_amb_OR: 7.03\n259\t    c2_omnibus_chi2: 19.8\n260\t    c2_omnibus_p: 0.0013\n261\t    c2_omnibus_df: 5\n262\t    c2_cramers_V: 0.115\n263\t    c2_actual_power: 0.971\n264\t    c2_MDE_V: 0.093\n265\t    c2_type_rates_pooled_amb:\n266\t      incompleteness: 46.4%\n267\t      lexical: 36.4%\n268\t      authorization_scope: 36.0%\n269\t      scopal: 34.4%\n270\t      conditional_precedence: 32.8%\n271\t      coreferential: 27.2%\n272\t    c2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: 19.2\n273\t    c2_3tier_structure: 'High: incomp (46.4%) | Mid: lex/auth/scopal/CP (32.8-36.4%)\n274\t      | Low: coref (27.2%)'\n275\t    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 6/15\n276\t    c2_tost_15pp_nonequivalent_pairs: 9/15\n277\t    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 2/15\n278\t    c2_tost_10pp_nonequivalent_pairs: 13/15\n279\t    c2_holm_significant_pairs: incomp-coref (p<0.001), incomp-CP (p=0.002)\n280\t    c3_spec_rate: 38.4%\n281\t    c3_ling_rate: 32.7%\n282\t    c3_layer_gap_pp: 5.7\n283\t    c3_pooled_chi2: 4.82\n284\t    c3_pooled_p: 0.028\n285\t    c3_pooled_V: 0.057\n286\t    c3_pooled_OR: 1.28\n287\t    c3_pooled_OR_ci: '[1.03, 1.59]'\n288\t    c3_within_judge_gpt41_group_gap_pp: 7.0\n289\t    c3_within_judge_gpt41_group_p: 0.11\n290\t    c3_within_judge_gpt54_group_gap_pp: 4.2\n291\t    c3_within_judge_gpt54_group_p: 0.22\n292\t    c3_per_model_layer_gaps_pp:\n293\t      gpt54: '+12.7'\n294\t      gpt41: '+10.7'\n295\t      claude: '+2.0'\n296\t      deepseek: '+1.3'\n297\t      qwen3: '0.0'\n298\t    c3_verdict: suggestive tendency, NOT confirmed\n299\t    c4_model_main_chi2_ambonly: 22.4\n300\t    c4_model_main_p_ambonly: 0.00017\n301\t    c4_model_main_V_ambonly: 0.122\n302\t    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 42\n303\t    c4_auth_scope_min: Claude 14%\n304\t    c4_auth_scope_max: GPT-5.4 56%\n305\t    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n306\t    c4_incomp_min: Claude 34%\n307\t    c4_incomp_max: Qwen3 54%\n308\t    c4_cp_range_pp: 4\n309\t    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.33\n310\t    c4_fleiss_interpretation: fair agreement\n311\t    c4_lr_interaction_chi2: 36.8\n312\t    c4_lr_interaction_p: 0.012\n313\t    c4_per_model_type_chi2:\n314\t      gpt54: χ²=18.2, p=0.003, V=0.25\n315\t      qwen3: χ²=14.2, p=0.014, V=0.22\n316\t      claude: χ²=9.8, p=0.08, V=0.18\n317\t      gpt41: χ²=8.2, p=0.15, V=0.17\n318\t      deepseek: χ²=4.8, p=0.44, V=0.13\n319\t    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.018\n320\t    logistic_token_delta_z: 2.81\n321\t    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.005\n322\t    logistic_model_aic_delta: -42.3\n323\t    intermodel_same_interpretation_rate: 0.24\n324\t    intermodel_systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.22\n325\t  result_rationale: \"C1 效应量从 best tier +34.0pp 缩至 +28.7pp，主要因为：(a) Claude 效应缩水最大（+25.7→+20.9pp），\\n\\\n326\t    其 auth_scope 极低 vulnerability 在 50-clause 全量集中更加显著地拉低 pooled value；\\n(b) Qwen3\\\n327\t    \\ 效应也偏低（+25.7pp），部分因 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%）；(c) 全量 50-clause 集\\n比 pilot 10-clause\\\n328\t    \\ 集多了更多 \\\"弱效应\\\" exemplars。但所有 5 模型 × 6 类型组合均显著 (p<0.001)，\\n核心 claim 完全成立。OR=11.2\\\n329\t    \\ 虽低于 best tier 15.1 但仍属 very large effect。\\n\\nC2 V=0.115 低于 best tier 0.137，但仍高于\\\n330\t    \\ MDE=0.093（power=0.971），type effect 真实存在\\n但较小。3-tier 结构中 mid-tier 更加压缩（32.8-36.4%\\\n331\t    \\ 仅 3.6pp 极差 vs best tier 36.8-42.8% 的 6pp），\\n意味着 mid-tier 内部类型近乎不可区分。只有 incomp-coref\\\n332\t    \\ 和 incomp-CP 在 Holm 校正后显著。\\nTOST 在 ±15pp 下 6/15 等价 (vs best tier 8/15) 反映整体分离度下降。\\n\\\n333\t    \\nC3 pooled p=0.028 形式上显著但 within-judge 两个子组均不显著 (p=0.11, p=0.22)。\\n根本原因：layer\\\n334\t    \\ gap 高度 model-dependent——GPT 模型 +10-13pp，Claude/DeepSeek/Qwen3 ≤ +2pp。\\ngpt-5.4\\\n335\t    \\ judged group 包含 GPT-4.1+Claude+Qwen3（后两者 gap≈0），所以子组效应被稀释。\\npooled 显著性可能反映 between-judge\\\n336\t    \\ variance 而非真实 layer effect。必须降级为 \\\"suggestive\\\"。\\n\\nC4 auth_scope 极差 42pp (vs\\\n337\t    \\ best tier 52pp) 因 GPT-5.4 从 64%→56%、DeepSeek 从 60%→48%。\\n缩小的极差削弱了 \\\"safety training\\\n338\t    \\ differentially mitigates auth_scope\\\" 的论证力度——\\n8pp 的缩小可能意味着 pilot 阶段 GPT-5.4\\\n339\t    \\ 高估了（sampling variance），也可能意味着 \\nprompt format 差异（API 参数、system prompt 细微不同）在\\\n340\t    \\ pilot 中被放大。需要 soften \\n因果解释。Claude 的 per-model type χ² 从显著 (p=0.003) 降至 borderline\\\n341\t    \\ (p=0.08)，\\n因为 Claude 在全量集中 auth_scope 14% 虽仍最低但其他类型也偏低（26-38%），整体 profile \\n\\\n342\t    更\\\"均匀地低\\\"而非\\\"选择性低\\\"。GPT-4.1 也失去了显著性 (p=0.15)。\\nFleiss κ=0.33 意味着模型间对具体 clause\\\n343\t    \\ 的 violation/no-violation 判定只有 fair agreement，\\nbinary effect 是 universal 的但\\\n344\t    \\ WHICH clauses trigger violations 高度 model-dependent。\\n\"\n345\t  tables:\n346\t  - title: C1 Per-Model Binary Effect Summary\n347\t    content: '| Model      | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect (pp) | Bootstrap 95% CI  |\n348\t      McNemar p  |\n349\t\n350\t      |------------|----------|------------|-------------|-------------------|------------|\n351\t\n352\t      | Claude     | 25.7%    | 4.8%       | +20.9       | [+16.2, +25.8]    | <10^-8     |\n353\t\n354\t      | Qwen3      | 33.3%    | 7.6%       | +25.7       | [+21.0, +31.4]    | <10^-8     |\n355\t\n356\t      | GPT-4.1    | 36.0%    | 6.2%       | +29.8       | [+24.8, +34.9]    | <10^-13    |\n357\t\n358\t      | GPT-5.4    | 38.3%    | 6.8%       | +31.5       | [+26.2, +36.8]    | <10^-14    |\n359\t\n360\t      | DeepSeek   | 43.3%    | 8.9%       | +34.4       | [+29.5, +39.3]    | <10^-14    |\n361\t\n362\t      | **Pooled** |**35.5%** | **6.9%**   |**+28.7**    |**[+25.8, +31.5]** |**<10^-30**\n363\t      |\n364\t\n365\t      '\n366\t  - title: C2 Per-Type Violation Rates (Ambiguous Condition, Pooled Across 5 Models)\n367\t    content: '| Tier | Type                 | Rate  | 95% CI        | vs Coref (pp)\n368\t      | Holm p  |\n369\t\n370\t      |------|----------------------|-------|---------------|---------------|---------|\n371\t\n372\t      | High | incompleteness       | 46.4% | [42.2, 50.6]  | +19.2         | <0.001  |\n373\t\n374\t      | Mid  | lexical              | 36.4% | [32.3, 40.5]  | +9.2          | 0.068   |\n375\t\n376\t      | Mid  | authorization_scope  | 36.0% | [31.9, 40.1]  | +8.8          | 0.078   |\n377\t\n378\t      | Mid  | scopal               | 34.4% | [30.3, 38.5]  | +7.2          | 0.14    |\n379\t\n380\t      | Mid  | conditional_prec.    | 32.8% | [28.7, 36.9]  | +5.6          | 0.27    |\n381\t\n382\t      | Low  | coreferential        | 27.2% | [23.3, 31.1]  | ref           | ref     |\n383\t\n384\t      '\n385\t  - title: C4 Model × Type Interaction Matrix (Ambiguous Condition Violation Rates)\n386\t    content: '| Type                | GPT-5.4 | GPT-4.1 | Claude | Qwen3 | DeepSeek\n387\t      | Range |\n388\t\n389\t      |---------------------|---------|---------|--------|-------|----------|-------|\n390\t\n391\t      | authorization_scope | 56%     | 42%     | 14%    | 20%   | 48%      | 42pp  |\n392\t\n393\t      | conditional_prec.   | 34%     | 32%     | 32%    | 32%   | 34%      | 2pp   |\n394\t\n395\t      | incompleteness      | 44%     | 50%     | 34%    | 54%   | 50%      | 20pp  |\n396\t\n397\t      | lexical             | 38%     | 30%     | 26%    | 40%   | 48%      | 22pp  |\n398\t\n399\t      | coreferential       | 20%     | 28%     | 20%    | 30%   | 38%      | 18pp  |\n400\t\n401\t      | scopal              | 38%     | 34%     | 28%    | 30%   | 42%      | 14pp  |\n402\t\n403\t      | **Model avg**       |**38.3%**|**36.0%**|**25.7%**|**34.3%**|**43.3%**|   |\n404\t\n405\t      '\n406\t  - title: C3 Per-Model Layer Gap\n407\t    content: '| Model    | Spec-Layer Avg | Ling-Layer Avg | Gap (pp) | Direction        |\n408\t\n409\t      |----------|----------------|----------------|----------|------------------|\n410\t\n411\t      | GPT-5.4  | 44.7%          | 32.0%          | +12.7    | spec > ling      |\n412\t\n413\t      | GPT-4.1  | 41.3%          | 30.7%          | +10.7    | spec > ling      |\n414\t\n415\t      | Claude   | 26.7%          | 24.7%          | +2.0     | negligible       |\n416\t\n417\t      | DeepSeek | 44.0%          | 42.7%          | +1.3     | negligible       |\n418\t\n419\t      | Qwen3    | 33.3%          | 33.3%          | 0.0      | no difference    |\n420\t\n421\t      |**Pooled**| **38.4%**      | **32.7%**      | **+5.7** | **suggestive**   |\n422\t\n423\t      '\n424\t  - title: Logistic Regression Coefficients (Full Model)\n425\t    content: '| Predictor          | Coef   | SE    | z     | p       | OR    |\n426\t\n427\t      |--------------------|--------|-------|-------|---------|-------|\n428\t\n429\t      | condition_amb      | 1.950  | 0.120 | 16.3  | <0.001  | 7.03  |\n430\t\n431\t      | model_gpt41        | 0.550  | 0.145 | 3.79  | <0.001  | 1.73  |\n432\t\n433\t      | model_gpt54        | 0.620  | 0.148 | 4.19  | <0.001  | 1.86  |\n434\t\n435\t      | model_qwen3        | 0.420  | 0.144 | 2.92  | 0.004   | 1.52  |\n436\t\n437\t      | model_deepseek     | 0.820  | 0.147 | 5.58  | <0.001  | 2.27  |\n438\t\n439\t      | type_auth_scope    | 0.420  | 0.168 | 2.50  | 0.012   | 1.52  |\n440\t\n441\t      | type_cp            | 0.280  | 0.165 | 1.70  | 0.089   | 1.32  |\n442\t\n443\t      | type_incomp        | 0.850  | 0.167 | 5.09  | <0.001  | 2.34  |\n444\t\n445\t      | type_lexical       | 0.440  | 0.169 | 2.60  | 0.009   | 1.55  |\n446\t\n447\t      | type_scopal        | 0.330  | 0.165 | 2.00  | 0.046   | 1.39  |\n448\t\n449\t      | token_delta        | 0.018  | 0.006 | 2.81  | 0.005   | 1.02  |\n450\t\n451\t      | model×type (LR)    | —      | —     | —     | 0.012   | —     |\n452\t\n453\t      '\n454\t  - title: TOST Equivalence Summary\n455\t    content: '| Margin | Equivalent | Non-Equivalent | Indeterminate |\n456\t\n457\t      |--------|------------|----------------|---------------|\n458\t\n459\t      | ±15pp  | 6/15       | 9/15           | 0/15          |\n460\t\n461\t      | ±10pp  | 2/15       | 13/15          | 0/15          |\n462\t\n463\t      '\n464\t  figures_description:\n465\t  - 'Figure 2 (Forest plot): Per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, pooled\n466\t    across 5 models. Incompleteness stands out; mid-tier cluster visible; coreferential\n467\t    lowest but CI still excludes 0'\n468\t  - 'Figure 3 (Heatmap): 5-model × 6-type violation rate matrix. Color gradient yellow-to-red.\n469\t    Auth_scope column shows dramatic cross-model variation; incompleteness row uniformly\n470\t    dark; CP row uniformly mid-range'\n471\t  - 'Figure: Layer gap by model — diverging bar chart showing GPT models positive,\n472\t    Claude/DeepSeek/Qwen3 near zero, illustrating model-dependence of C3'\n473\t  analysis: \"C1 robust but effect smaller than anticipated. Paper 需报告 pooled +28.7pp\\\n474\t    \\ 和 per-model range \\n[+20.9, +34.4]，避免 cherry-picking pooled value。Claude 的 +20.9pp\\\n475\t    \\ 虽是最低但仍 massive \\n(OR>4, p<10^-8)。\\nC2 3-tier 结构成立但 mid-tier 压缩。TOST 显示类型不可互换（±10pp\\\n476\t    \\ 仅 2/15 等价），\\n但精细排序不可靠。Paper 应强调 incomp 的 outlier 地位和 coref 的 low-end boundary\\\n477\t    \\ case，\\n不要细排 mid-tier 内部顺序。\\nC3 必须降级。pooled p=0.028 仅反映大样本效应，within-judge 不显著说明\\\n478\t    \\ 5.7pp 的 gap \\n可能 partly artifactual。建议移入 Discussion §7 作为 \\\"observed pattern\\\"\\\n479\t    \\ 而非 Results §5 \\n的 standalone finding。Layer gap 的 model-dependence 反而是有价值的 C4\\\n480\t    \\ 支持证据。\\nC4 是 star finding。auth_scope 42pp 极差仍然 dramatic，但需 soften 表述为 \\n\\\"consistent\\\n481\t    \\ with differential safety training effects, though prompt format sensitivity\\\n482\t    \\ cannot be excluded\\\"。\\nFleiss κ=0.33 是重要发现——models agree on WHETHER ambiguity\\\n483\t    \\ hurts but disagree on WHICH clauses。\\n\"\n484\t- name: error_analysis\n485\t  plan_id: plan_005\n486\t  description: '从 violation traces 中抽样 ~360 条（5 models × 6 types × ~12 traces/cell），\n487\t\n488\t    分类 failure modes，分析跨模型/跨类型一致性，量化 Ambiguity Blindness。\n489\t\n490\t    '\n491\t  expected_results:\n492\t    total_traces_analyzed: 358\n493\t    traces_per_model:\n494\t      gpt54: 78\n495\t      gpt41: 74\n496\t      claude: 42\n497\t      qwen3: 68\n498\t      deepseek: 96\n499\t    pooled_failure_modes:\n500\t      assumption_based_action: 31.3%\n501\t      scope_misapplication: 27.4%\n502\t      unauthorized_escalation: 23.5%\n503\t      arbitrary_rule_selection: 9.2%\n504\t      conservative_refusal: 5.3%\n505\t      other: 3.4%\n506\t    types_with_consistent_dominant_mode: 4\n507\t    types_with_divergent_modes: 2\n508\t    consistent_types: auth_scope (unauthorized_escalation), incompleteness (assumption_based_action),\n509\t      scopal (scope_misapplication), CP (scope_misapplication+arbitrary_rule_selection)\n510\t    divergent_types: lexical (GPT→assumption_based_action, OS→scope_misapplication),\n511\t      coreferential (flat distribution, no dominant mode)\n512\t    awareness_rate_pct: 9.2\n513\t    awareness_range_by_model: '[4.8% (GPT-5.4), 14.3% (Claude)]'\n514\t    surface_adoption_pct: 84.1\n515\t    escalate_to_user_pct: 1.1\n516\t    ling_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 36.2\n517\t    spec_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 13.8\n518\t    spec_layer_escalation_plus_assumption_pct: 62.4\n519\t    airline_vs_retail_max_delta_pp: 14.2\n520\t    airline_vs_retail_delta_type: unauthorized_escalation (retail 37.1% vs airline\n521\t      22.9%)\n522\t    coreferential_conservative_refusal_pct: 8.4\n523\t    coreferential_n_traces: 28\n524\t    cross_coding_n: 72\n525\t    cross_coding_agreement_pct: 76.4\n526\t    cross_coding_cohens_kappa: 0.548\n527\t    gwets_AC1: 0.682\n528\t  result_rationale: \"4/6 类型跨 5 模型一致（vs best tier 5/6），原因：\\n(1) auth_scope→unauthorized_escalation\\\n529\t    \\ 在 Claude 上只有 ~7 条 traces（14% rate × 50 episodes），\\n    其中 45% 是 unauthorized_escalation、25%\\\n530\t    \\ conservative_refusal——pattern 不同但 N 太小不影响\\n    overall consistency（4/5 模型仍以\\\n531\t    \\ unauthorized_escalation 为主导）；\\n(2) incompleteness 和 scopal 的 failure mode 由\\\n532\t    \\ ambiguity type 本身的结构决定（缺信息→猜测行动，\\n    scope 模糊→misapply scope），不依赖模型架构，故高度一致；\\n\\\n533\t    (3) lexical 类型出现 model-family 分裂：GPT 系列将词汇歧义处理为信息缺口（assumption_based_action 60-68%），\\n\\\n534\t    \\    open-source 模型（Qwen3, DeepSeek）更倾向 scope_misapplication（45-52%），可能反映 \\n \\\n535\t    \\   training data 中对词汇多义性的不同处理策略。这是 median 档独有的发现——best tier 中\\n    只有 2 模型，未能检测到此\\\n536\t    \\ family-level divergence；\\n(4) coreferential 仍无主导 failure mode（flat distribution），N=28\\\n537\t    \\ traces 中 scope_misapplication 30%、\\n    assumption_based_action 25%、unauthorized_escalation\\\n538\t    \\ 18%——三种模式均无法突出。\\n\\nAwareness rate 9.2% 高于 best tier GPT-5.4 的 4.1% 但符合范围，因为\\\n539\t    \\ Claude 的 awareness 最高\\n（14.3%——其 RLHF 可能 implicitly 训练了更多 metacognitive hedging）。Surface\\\n540\t    \\ adoption 84.1% \\n略低于 best tier 88%+，反映 5-model pool 中有更多 variance。\\n\\nCross-coding\\\n541\t    \\ κ=0.548 低于 best tier 0.594，因为 5-model traces 引入了更多 edge cases（尤其 \\nQwen3 和 DeepSeek\\\n542\t    \\ 的 failure mode 表述风格不同于 GPT 系列）。Gwet's AC1=0.682 好于 κ，\\n因为 kappa paradox 在 high-prevalence\\\n543\t    \\ categories 中更严重。\\n\"\n544\t  tables:\n545\t  - title: Failure Mode × Type Distribution (Pooled Across 5 Models)\n546\t    content: '| Type          | assumption | unauth_esc | scope_misapp | arb_rule\n547\t      | conserv_ref | other |\n548\t\n549\t      |---------------|-----------|------------|--------------|----------|-------------|-------|\n550\t\n551\t      | auth_scope    | 15%       | 68%        | 8%           | 2%       | 4%          |\n552\t      3%    |\n553\t\n554\t      | CP            | 22%       | 8%         | 35%          | 28%      | 4%          |\n555\t      3%    |\n556\t\n557\t      | incompleteness| 60%       | 18%        | 10%          | 6%       | 3%          |\n558\t      3%    |\n559\t\n560\t      | lexical       | 52%       | 6%         | 28%          | 6%       | 4%          |\n561\t      4%    |\n562\t\n563\t      | coreferential | 25%       | 18%        | 30%          | 8%       | 12%         |\n564\t      7%    |\n565\t\n566\t      | scopal        | 10%       | 5%         | 72%          | 6%       | 4%          |\n567\t      3%    |\n568\t\n569\t      '\n570\t  - title: Lexical Failure Mode by Model Family (Divergent Type)\n571\t    content: '| Model Family  | assumption_based | scope_misapp | other modes |\n572\t\n573\t      |---------------|-----------------|--------------|-------------|\n574\t\n575\t      | GPT-5.4       | 64%             | 18%          | 18%         |\n576\t\n577\t      | GPT-4.1       | 60%             | 22%          | 18%         |\n578\t\n579\t      | Claude        | 58%             | 24%          | 18%         |\n580\t\n581\t      | Qwen3         | 38%             | 45%          | 17%         |\n582\t\n583\t      | DeepSeek      | 35%             | 52%          | 13%         |\n584\t\n585\t      '\n586\t  - title: Ambiguity Blindness Metrics by Model\n587\t    content: '| Model    | Awareness | Surface Adoption | Escalate to User |\n588\t\n589\t      |----------|-----------|------------------|------------------|\n590\t\n591\t      | GPT-5.4  | 4.8%      | 88.2%            | 0.6%             |\n592\t\n593\t      | GPT-4.1  | 10.2%     | 83.7%            | 1.4%             |\n594\t\n595\t      | Claude   | 14.3%     | 78.4%            | 2.1%             |\n596\t\n597\t      | Qwen3    | 8.6%      | 84.2%            | 0.8%             |\n598\t\n599\t      | DeepSeek | 5.9%      | 86.8%            | 0.4%             |\n600\t\n601\t      |**Pooled**| **9.2%**  | **84.1%**        | **1.1%**         |\n602\t\n603\t      '\n604\t  figures_description:\n605\t  - 'Figure 5 (Stacked bar): Per-type failure mode distribution, showing type-diagnostic\n606\t    signatures — auth_scope dominated by red (unauthorized_escalation), incompleteness\n607\t    by blue (assumption_based_action), scopal by green (scope_misapplication)'\n608\t  - 'Figure 6 (Split panel): Lexical failure modes by model family — left panel GPT-family\n609\t    (assumption dominant), right panel OS-family (scope_misapplication dominant),\n610\t    illustrating the 2-type divergence'\n611\t  - 'Figure 7 (Annotated trace pair): CP trace showing explicit conflict detection\n612\t    (''I notice rules A and B appear to conflict'') vs scopal trace showing zero awareness\n613\t    and surface scope adoption'\n614\t  analysis: \"C5 核心发现（type-specific signatures + Ambiguity Blindness）成立，但跨模型一致性需 soften。\\n\\\n615\t    Paper 表述从 \\\"5/6 types converge\\\" 改为 \\\"4/6 types show consistent dominant failure\\\n616\t    \\ modes across \\nall 5 models; lexical type shows a model-family split (GPT →\\\n617\t    \\ assumption, OS → scope misapplication); \\ncoreferential shows no dominant mode\\\n618\t    \\ reflecting diverse resolution strategies\\\"。\\nLexical 的 model-family split 是\\\n619\t    \\ median 档的独有洞察——可以在 Discussion 中讨论 training data \\ncomposition 如何影响 failure mode，但不应\\\n620\t    \\ overclaim 因果关系。\\nAmbiguity Blindness 数据显示 Claude 的 awareness 最高 (14.3%)，与其最低\\\n621\t    \\ violation rate 一致——\\n但不能推断因果（可能是 RLHF 导致更多 hedging 而非真正的 ambiguity detection）。\\n\\\n622\t    Cross-coding κ=0.548 需在 paper 中 report 并 caveat：\\\"automated coding shows moderate\\\n623\t    \\ agreement; \\nfine-grained per-type percentages should be interpreted as approximate。\\\"\\\n624\t    \\n\"\n625\t- name: reliability_test\n626\t  plan_id: plan_006\n627\t  description: '30 representative clauses (5/type) × 3 replicates × 2 conditions ×\n628\t    2 API models = 360 episodes。\n629\t\n630\t    计算 ICC 评估 per-clause violation rate 的 test-retest reliability。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    total_episodes: 358\n635\t    episodes_complete: 355\n636\t    episodes_pending_judgment: 3\n637\t    overall_ICC: 0.882\n638\t    overall_ICC_ci: '[0.842, 0.915]'\n639\t    binary_ICC: 0.814\n640\t    binary_ICC_ci: '[0.758, 0.860]'\n641\t    per_model_ICC:\n642\t      gpt54: 0.889\n643\t      gpt41: 0.875\n644\t    per_type_ICC:\n645\t      scopal: 0.952\n646\t      lexical: 0.938\n647\t      coreferential: 0.924\n648\t      authorization_scope: 0.834\n649\t      conditional_precedence: 0.821\n650\t      incompleteness: 0.792\n651\t    per_layer_ICC:\n652\t      ling_layer_avg: 0.938\n653\t      spec_layer_avg: 0.816\n654\t    bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp: 8.2\n655\t  result_rationale: \"Overall ICC=0.882 (good) 略低于 best tier 0.919（excellent），因为：\\n\\\n656\t    (1) 30-clause 子集中 spec-layer clauses 的 replicate variance 较高——incompleteness 的某些\\\n657\t    \\ \\n    clauses 在 3 次 replicate 中分别得到 0/1/1 的 violation 结果（20%-80% swing），这是因为\\\n658\t    \\ \\n    spec-layer ambiguity 缺乏外部消歧渠道，agent 每次 \\\"猜\\\" 不同方向；\\n(2) Ling-layer clauses（scopal,\\\n659\t    \\ lexical, coref）ICC 全部 >0.92，因为其消歧路径（tool response、\\n    世界知识）在 replicate 间稳定；\\n\\\n660\t    (3) Per-model ICC 接近（0.889 vs 0.875），说明 reliability 不依赖模型选择；\\n(4) Bootstrap CI\\\n661\t    \\ 中位宽度 8.2pp 高于目标 <10pp，勉强 PASS——意味着 individual clause-level \\n    的 effect size\\\n662\t    \\ 估计有 ~±4pp 不确定性，但 type-level 和 pooled 分析因聚合效应而更精确。\\nSpec-layer 低 ICC 是 Disambiguation\\\n663\t    \\ Channel Framework 的直接预测——agent 对 spec-layer \\nambiguity 的响应更不可预测，因为没有 external\\\n664\t    \\ signal 来锚定解读。\\n\"\n665\t  tables:\n666\t  - title: ICC by Type and Layer\n667\t    content: '| Layer | Type                | ICC   | 95% CI        | Interpretation\n668\t      |\n669\t\n670\t      |-------|---------------------|-------|---------------|----------------|\n671\t\n672\t      | Ling  | scopal              | 0.952 | [0.912, 0.978]| excellent      |\n673\t\n674\t      | Ling  | lexical             | 0.938 | [0.892, 0.968]| excellent      |\n675\t\n676\t      | Ling  | coreferential       | 0.924 | [0.871, 0.960]| excellent      |\n677\t\n678\t      | Spec  | authorization_scope | 0.834 | [0.748, 0.904]| good           |\n679\t\n680\t      | Spec  | conditional_prec.   | 0.821 | [0.732, 0.893]| good           |\n681\t\n682\t      | Spec  | incompleteness      | 0.792 | [0.694, 0.873]| good           |\n683\t\n684\t      |       | **Overall**         |**0.882**|**[0.842, 0.915]**| **good**   |\n685\t\n686\t      '\n687\t  figures_description:\n688\t  - 'ICC forest plot by type: ling-layer types clustered at 0.92-0.95, spec-layer\n689\t    at 0.79-0.83, clear layer separation visible'\n690\t  analysis: \"Reliability 达到 good 水平但未达 excellent。Paper 可以报告 \\\"per-clause violation\\\n691\t    \\ rates show \\ngood test-retest reliability (ICC=0.882)\\\"，但需在 Limitations 中提及\\\n692\t    \\ spec-layer types 的 \\nlower reliability (ICC 0.79-0.83) 及其对 fine-grained per-clause\\\n693\t    \\ inference 的限制。\\nICC 的 layer pattern (ling > spec) 是 Disambiguation Channel Framework\\\n694\t    \\ 的 convergent evidence——\\n但在 median 档下只能作为 \\\"consistent with\\\" 而非 \\\"supports\\\"\\\n695\t    。\\n\"\n696\t- name: realism_validation\n697\t  plan_id: plan_007\n698\t  description: '比较 300 synthetic clause pairs 与 DRIP-R 自然 ambiguity 的语言学属性\n699\t\n700\t    (sentence length, parse depth, Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, token count)，\n701\t\n702\t    KS 检验判断分布差异。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t  expected_results:\n706\t    n_synthetic: 300\n707\t    n_drip_r_reference: 187\n708\t    ks_sentence_length_p: 0.041\n709\t    ks_sentence_length_D: 0.142\n710\t    ks_parse_depth_p: 0.34\n711\t    ks_flesch_kincaid_p: 0.42\n712\t    ks_ttr_p: 0.28\n713\t    ks_token_count_p: 0.18\n714\t    synthetic_mean_sentence_length: 22.3\n715\t    drip_r_mean_sentence_length: 19.8\n716\t    significant_properties: 1\n717\t    nonsignificant_properties: 4\n718\t  result_rationale: \"4/5 语言学属性无显著差异，说明 synthetic injection 没有创造系统性的表面特征偏差。\\nSentence\\\n719\t    \\ length (p=0.041) 显著偏高 (22.3 vs 19.8 words)，原因：消歧操作（尤其 spec-layer \\ntypes 添加条件子句）使\\\n720\t    \\ ambiguous 版本在移除消歧内容后仍保留了较复杂的句法结构。\\n这是一个 minor confound——更长的句子可能本身就更难处理，但 plan_004\\\n721\t    \\ 的 logistic regression \\n已将 token_delta 作为 control variable（coef=0.018, p=0.005），显示其效应存在但远小于\\\n722\t    \\ \\nambiguity condition 效应（coef=1.95）。\\nParse depth, readability, lexical diversity\\\n723\t    \\ 和 token count 均在 DRIP-R 分布范围内，\\n表明 synthetic clauses 的整体语言复杂度与自然 policy ambiguity\\\n724\t    \\ 一致。\\n\"\n725\t  tables:\n726\t  - title: 'Linguistic Property Comparison: Synthetic vs DRIP-R'\n727\t    content: '| Property        | Synthetic (mean±sd) | DRIP-R (mean±sd) | KS D  |\n728\t      KS p  | Sig?  |\n729\t\n730\t      |-----------------|---------------------|-------------------|-------|-------|-------|\n731\t\n732\t      | Sentence length | 22.3 ± 6.8         | 19.8 ± 5.4        | 0.142 | 0.041 |\n733\t      *     |\n734\t\n735\t      | Parse depth     | 5.2 ± 1.9          | 5.0 ± 1.7         | 0.087 | 0.34  |\n736\t      n.s.  |\n737\t\n738\t      | Flesch-Kincaid  | 11.4 ± 2.3         | 11.1 ± 2.1        | 0.078 | 0.42  |\n739\t      n.s.  |\n740\t\n741\t      | TTR             | 0.68 ± 0.12        | 0.71 ± 0.11       | 0.092 | 0.28  |\n742\t      n.s.  |\n743\t\n744\t      | Token count     | 28.7 ± 8.4         | 26.2 ± 7.1        | 0.103 | 0.18  |\n745\t      n.s.  |\n746\t\n747\t      '\n748\t  figures_description:\n749\t  - 'Overlaid density plots for each property: synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange).\n750\t    Only sentence length shows visible right-shift for synthetic'\n751\t  analysis: \"Realism validation 整体 PASS。Sentence length 差异需在 Method §4 中 disclose：\\n\\\n752\t    \\\"Synthetic clauses are marginally longer than naturally occurring policy ambiguities\\\n753\t    \\ \\n(22.3 vs 19.8 words, KS p=0.041), reflecting the structural complexity required\\\n754\t    \\ for \\nmatched-pair design. Token delta is included as a control variable in\\\n755\t    \\ all regression analyses.\\\"\\n这不影响核心 claims 但是 honest reporting 的要求。\\n\"\n756\t- name: judge_calibration\n757\t  plan_id: plan_009\n758\t  description: '100 episodes stratified 抽样 × 2 human annotators 标注，\n759\t\n760\t    计算 LLM judge 与 human ground truth 的 precision/recall/F1，\n761\t\n762\t    per-severity-tier agreement，以及 20-30 failure mode traces 的人工验证。\n763\t\n764\t    '\n765\t  expected_results:\n766\t    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n767\t    n_human_annotators: 2\n768\t    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.78\n769\t    human_agreement_pct: 88.0\n770\t    judge_human_binary_kappa: 0.74\n771\t    judge_human_binary_F1: 0.87\n772\t    judge_human_binary_precision: 0.89\n773\t    judge_human_binary_recall: 0.87\n774\t    judge_human_severity_kappa: 0.65\n775\t    judge_human_severity_weighted_F1: 0.8\n776\t    per_severity_F1:\n777\t      no_violation: 0.9\n778\t      minor_violation: 0.68\n779\t      moderate_violation: 0.82\n780\t      severe_violation: 0.88\n781\t    most_confused_pair: minor_violation ↔ no_violation\n782\t    confusion_rate_minor_as_none: 26.7% (4/15)\n783\t    confusion_rate_none_as_minor: 13.3% (6/45)\n784\t    n_failure_mode_traces_validated: 24\n785\t    failure_mode_human_agreement_pct: 70.8\n786\t    failure_mode_dominant_mode_match: 5/6 types match human coding\n787\t  result_rationale: \"Human κ=0.78 (good) 达到 target ≥0.75，说明 violation 判定任务的人类 ground\\\n788\t    \\ truth 可靠。\\nJudge binary F1=0.87 属于 adequate——大多数 \\\"明确 violation\\\"（如 unauthorized\\\n789\t    \\ refund、越权操作）\\n和 \\\"明确 no-violation\\\" 被正确分类。但 minor violation tier F1=0.68 显著低于其他\\\n790\t    \\ tier，\\n原因：(1) minor violations 本身定义模糊——\\\"slightly exceeding scope\\\" vs \\\"reasonable\\\n791\t    \\ interpretation\\\" \\n的边界是主观的；(2) LLM judge 倾向于二值化（clear violation or not），对中间地带不敏感；\\n\\\n792\t    (3) 15 个 human-labeled minor violations 中有 4 个被 judge 归为 no-violation（26.7% miss\\\n793\t    \\ rate）。\\n\\nJudge-human κ=0.72 低于 judge-judge κ=0.91（来自 best tier framing 数据），正是\\\n794\t    \\ plan_009 \\n被升级为 P0 的原因——judge 之间高度一致不等于 judge 准确。κ=0.72 的 gap 集中在 minor \\nviolations\\\n795\t    \\ 和 auth_scope 的 boundary cases 上。\\n\\nSeverity tier 的不稳定性意味着 paper 应以 binary violation\\\n796\t    \\ 为主要分析单元，\\nseverity-based 分析作为 supplementary。plan_005 的 failure mode coding 在\\\n797\t    \\ 24 traces \\n人工验证中 70.8% agreement，5/6 types 的 dominant mode 与人工编码一致，\\n但 auth_scope\\\n798\t    \\ 的 unauthorized_escalation vs inappropriate_action 边界仍模糊。\\n\\n整体判定：judge 在 binary\\\n799\t    \\ level 可信（F1=0.87, κ=0.74），在 severity level 有 noise \\n但不影响核心 claims（C1-C4 均基于\\\n800\t    \\ binary violation）。\\n\"\n801\t  tables:\n802\t  - title: Judge vs Human Confusion Matrix (Binary)\n803\t    content: '|                    | Judge: No Violation | Judge: Violation |\n804\t\n805\t      |--------------------|---------------------|------------------|\n806\t\n807\t      | Human: No Violation| 39                  | 6                |\n808\t\n809\t      | Human: Violation   | 7                   | 48               |\n810\t\n811\t      | **Metrics**        | Precision=0.85      | Precision=0.89   |\n812\t\n813\t      |                    | **Binary κ=0.74**   | **Binary F1=0.87**|\n814\t\n815\t      '\n816\t  - title: Per-Severity-Tier F1\n817\t    content: '| Severity Tier    | N (human) | Precision | Recall | F1   | Primary\n818\t      Confusion     |\n819\t\n820\t      |------------------|-----------|-----------|--------|------|-----------------------|\n821\t\n822\t      | No violation     | 45        | 0.85      | 0.87   | 0.90 | ← minor (6 cases)    |\n823\t\n824\t      | Minor violation  | 15        | 0.69      | 0.67   | 0.68 | → no_violation\n825\t      (4)    |\n826\t\n827\t      | Moderate         | 22        | 0.82      | 0.82   | 0.82 | ↔ minor/severe\n828\t      (4)   |\n829\t\n830\t      | Severe           | 18        | 0.88      | 0.89   | 0.88 | ← moderate (2)        |\n831\t\n832\t      '\n833\t  figures_description:\n834\t  - 'Confusion heatmap: 4×4 matrix showing strong diagonal with off-diagonal concentration\n835\t    at minor↔no_violation boundary'\n836\t  - 'Per-tier F1 bar chart with 95% Wilson CI: minor tier''s CI extends below 0.60,\n837\t    other tiers well above 0.75'\n838\t  analysis: \"Judge calibration 在 binary level 充分，在 severity level 有 caveat。Paper Method\\\n839\t    \\ §4 报告：\\n\\\"LLM judge achieves good agreement with human ground truth (binary\\\n840\t    \\ κ=0.74, F1=0.87). \\nSeverity-tier classification is less reliable (weighted\\\n841\t    \\ F1=0.80), with minor violations \\nshowing the lowest agreement (F1=0.68). All\\\n842\t    \\ primary analyses use binary violation classification.\\\"\\nMinor tier 的低 F1 不影响\\\n843\t    \\ C1-C4（均基于 binary），但如果 paper 报告 severity 分布\\n（如 C5 error analysis 中区分 severity），需要\\\n844\t    \\ caveat。\\nFailure mode validation (70.8% agreement, 24 traces) 虽 N 小但 5/6 dominant\\\n845\t    \\ mode match \\n提供了基本的 face validity。完整的 human failure mode coding 留作 future work。\\n\"\n846\t- name: perturbation_control\n847\t  plan_id: plan_010\n848\t  description: '30 non-ambiguity perturbation pairs (15 synonym + 15 reorder) × 2\n849\t    conditions × 3 API models = 180 episodes。\n850\t\n851\t    区分 ambiguity-specific harm 与 general prompt brittleness。\n852\t\n853\t    '\n854\t  expected_results:\n855\t    total_episodes: 178\n856\t    episodes_failed: 2\n857\t    perturbation_types:\n858\t      synonym: 15\n859\t      reorder: 15\n860\t    original_violation_rate: 0.067\n861\t    perturbed_violation_rate: 0.139\n862\t    delta_perturb_pp: 7.2\n863\t    delta_perturb_ci: '[1.5, 12.9]'\n864\t    delta_perturb_ci_contains_zero: false\n865\t    ambiguity_delta_pp: 28.7\n866\t    delta_net_pp: 21.5\n867\t    ratio: 0.251\n868\t    verdict: PASS+caveat\n869\t    synonym_delta_pp: 5.8\n870\t    reorder_delta_pp: 8.6\n871\t    per_model_perturb_delta:\n872\t      gpt54: 8.3\n873\t      gpt41: 6.1\n874\t      claude: 4.8\n875\t  result_rationale: \"Δ_perturb=7.2pp 显著高于 best tier 的 3.33pp（CI 含 0），原因：\\n(1) Synonym\\\n876\t    \\ substitution 中部分 \\\"同义词\\\" 实际有微妙语义差异——如 \\\"refund\\\" → \\\"reimbursement\\\" \\n    在\\\n877\t    \\ policy 语境下可能暗示不同的处理流程，agent 对此敏感；\\n(2) Clause reordering 效应更大 (8.6pp vs synonym\\\n878\t    \\ 5.8pp)，因为条件子句的顺序影响 agent \\n    的 salience weighting——先出现的条件被赋予更高权重（primacy effect），重排后某些\\\n879\t    \\ \\n    exception 条件被 \\\"buried\\\" 导致 agent 忽略；\\n(3) GPT-5.4 对 perturbation 最敏感\\\n880\t    \\ (8.3pp)，Claude 最稳健 (4.8pp)，与 overall \\n    prompt sensitivity 的 model ranking\\\n881\t    \\ 一致。\\n\\nCI [1.5, 12.9] 不含 0 是关键 caveat——意味着非歧义性表面改动确实造成了 non-trivial \\n的 violation\\\n882\t    \\ rate 增加。但 ratio=0.251 表明歧义效应 (28.7pp) 远大于一般敏感性 (7.2pp)，\\nnet effect 21.5pp 仍然\\\n883\t    \\ massive。\\n\\n判定标准：5-10pp + ratio 0.15-0.30 = PASS+caveat。\\nPaper 需写：\\\"Ambiguity\\\n884\t    \\ causes violations substantially beyond general prompt sensitivity \\n(Δ_net=21.5pp,\\\n885\t    \\ 75% of the total ambiguity effect is ambiguity-specific), though non-ambiguity\\\n886\t    \\ \\nperturbations also produce a small but significant increase (Δ_perturb=7.2pp,\\\n887\t    \\ CI [1.5, 12.9]).\\\"\\n\"\n888\t  tables:\n889\t  - title: Perturbation Control Summary\n890\t    content: '| Metric                  | Value             | Interpretation              |\n891\t\n892\t      |-------------------------|-------------------|-----------------------------|\n893\t\n894\t      | Δ_perturb (overall)     | 7.2pp [1.5, 12.9] | significant, small          |\n895\t\n896\t      | Δ_perturb (synonym)     | 5.8pp             | borderline significant      |\n897\t\n898\t      | Δ_perturb (reorder)     | 8.6pp             | significant                 |\n899\t\n900\t      | Δ_ambiguity (from C1)   | 28.7pp            | massive                     |\n901\t\n902\t      | Δ_net                   | 21.5pp            | ambiguity-specific, large   |\n903\t\n904\t      | Ratio (perturb/ambig)   | 0.251             | 25% attributable to surface\n905\t      |\n906\t\n907\t      | **Verdict**             | **PASS+caveat**   | C1 holds with net framing   |\n908\t\n909\t      '\n910\t  - title: Per-Model Perturbation Sensitivity\n911\t    content: '| Model    | Original Rate | Perturbed Rate | Δ_perturb (pp) |\n912\t\n913\t      |----------|---------------|----------------|-----------------|\n914\t\n915\t      | GPT-5.4  | 7.8%          | 16.1%          | +8.3            |\n916\t\n917\t      | GPT-4.1  | 6.3%          | 12.4%          | +6.1            |\n918\t\n919\t      | Claude   | 4.2%          | 9.0%           | +4.8            |\n920\t\n921\t      '\n922\t  figures_description:\n923\t  - 'Three-bar comparison: Δ_perturb (7.2pp, gray), Δ_net (21.5pp, blue), total Δ_ambiguity\n924\t    (28.7pp, red). Stacked to show composition. Error bars on each component.'\n925\t  analysis: \"Perturbation control 是 median 档与 best tier 的关键差异。Best tier Δ_perturb=3.33pp\\\n926\t    \\ (CI含0) \\n允许最强因果 claim；median 档 7.2pp (CI不含0) 要求 net effect framing。\\nPaper C1\\\n927\t    \\ 的核心句从 \\\"ambiguity-specific causation\\\" 改为 \\\"ambiguity causes violations \\nsubstantially\\\n928\t    \\ beyond general prompt sensitivity\\\"——这仍然是 strong claim 但诚实承认了 \\n一部分效应来自表面改动。Δ_net=21.5pp\\\n929\t    \\ 仍是 agent safety 文献中最大的因果估计。\\nReorder > synonym 的发现本身是有意义的——可在 Discussion 中简短讨论\\\n930\t    \\ clause ordering \\nas a prompt sensitivity factor。但不要 overclaim，这只有 15 pairs。\\n\\\n931\t    建议：在 appendix 中补充额外 30 pairs（15 synonym + 15 reorder）以收窄 CI 至 <8pp width，\\n这是\\\n932\t    \\ median 档需要的 robustness check 之一。\\n\"\n933\t- name: classifier_poc\n934\t  plan_id: plan_008\n935\t  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC：在 300 clause pairs\n936\t    上 fine-tune，\n937\t\n938\t    80/20 split，评估 held-out performance。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t  expected_results:\n942\t    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n943\t    train_pairs: 240\n944\t    test_pairs: 60\n945\t    epochs: 5\n946\t    learning_rate: 2.0e-05\n947\t    test_binary_F1: 0.78\n948\t    test_precision: 0.81\n949\t    test_recall: 0.75\n950\t    test_AUC: 0.85\n951\t    per_type_F1:\n952\t      incompleteness: 0.86\n953\t      authorization_scope: 0.82\n954\t      conditional_precedence: 0.76\n955\t      lexical: 0.79\n956\t      scopal: 0.73\n957\t      coreferential: 0.68\n958\t    gpu_hours_used: 2.4\n959\t    training_cost_usd: 8.5\n960\t  result_rationale: \"F1=0.78 是 reasonable PoC 性能但不突出，原因：\\n(1) 训练集仅 240 pairs，对 DeBERTa\\\n961\t    \\ 来说是 very low resource setting；\\n(2) 每种类型仅 ~40 train examples，不足以学到 type-specific\\\n962\t    \\ patterns；\\n(3) Per-type 性能与 disambiguation token delta 高度相关：incompleteness (35.5\\\n963\t    \\ tokens avg edit) \\n    最容易检测（F1=0.86），因为 ambiguous 和 unambiguous 版本表面差异大；\\n\\\n964\t    \\    coreferential (8.2 tokens) 最难（F1=0.68），因为差异仅在代词或 RC attachment 上。\\n\\nF1=0.78\\\n965\t    \\ 足以证明 \\\"automated ambiguity detection is feasible\\\" 这一 practical implication，\\n\\\n966\t    但不足以作为 standalone contribution。定位为 appendix PoC，标题可以是 \\n\\\"Preliminary: Toward\\\n967\t    \\ Automated Policy Ambiguity Detection\\\"。\\nChantree et al. (2006) 的 nocuous ambiguity\\\n968\t    \\ detector 在 controlled dataset 上 \\nprecision ~80%——与我们的 0.81 precision 可比，但他们的\\\n969\t    \\ recall 更高 (~0.85)，\\n可能因为他们的 training set 更大且 domain-specific features 更多。\\n\"\n970\t  tables:\n971\t  - title: Classifier PoC Results by Type\n972\t    content: '| Type                | Test N | F1   | Precision | Recall | Avg Token\n973\t      Δ |\n974\t\n975\t      |---------------------|--------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\n976\t\n977\t      | incompleteness      | 10     | 0.86 | 0.88      | 0.84   | 35.5        |\n978\t\n979\t      | authorization_scope | 10     | 0.82 | 0.84      | 0.80   | 37.8        |\n980\t\n981\t      | lexical             | 10     | 0.79 | 0.82      | 0.76   | 14.6        |\n982\t\n983\t      | conditional_prec.   | 10     | 0.76 | 0.78      | 0.74   | 29.4        |\n984\t\n985\t      | scopal              | 10     | 0.73 | 0.75      | 0.71   | 16.4        |\n986\t\n987\t      | coreferential       | 10     | 0.68 | 0.72      | 0.65   | 8.2         |\n988\t\n989\t      | **Overall**         | **60** |**0.78**|**0.81** |**0.75**| 23.7        |\n990\t\n991\t      '\n992\t  figures_description:\n993\t  - ROC curve (AUC=0.85) with per-type operating points marked, showing incompleteness\n994\t    near top-left corner and coreferential closer to diagonal\n995\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-type F1 vs avg disambiguation token delta, showing strong positive\n996\t    correlation (r=0.91)'\n997\t  analysis: \"PoC 成功 demonstrate feasibility。F1 与 token delta 的 r=0.91 相关性本身是有趣的发现——\\n\\\n998\t    说明 classifier 主要依赖 surface-level 信号（信息量差异）而非深层语义理解。\\n这暗示更好的 classifier 需要 semantic\\\n999\t    \\ representations 而非纯 surface features。\\nPaper 中作为 §7 Discussion 的一段或 Appendix\\\n1000\t    \\ B，不列为 main contribution。\\n连线 Chantree et al. (2006): \\\"Our PoC achieves comparable\\\n1001\t    \\ precision (0.81 vs ~0.80) \\nwith substantially less training data, suggesting\\\n1002\t    \\ modern PLMs can bootstrap from small \\nannotated datasets for ambiguity detection.\\\"\"\n1003\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"529c2bcd-cbb0-40d3-96ae-cb3dd8214c76","uuid":"79a2b232-8900-4608-8635-4de6766bbaba","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:15:21.772Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T041241/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: \"核心叙事保持但需降低三处 claim 强度：\\n(1) C3 layer effect 从 \\\"significant\\\"\\\n  \\ 降为 \\\"suggestive tendency\\\"，Disambiguation Channel 从 explanatory framework 进一步降为\\n\\\n  \\    \\\"observed pattern consistent with\\\"，layer 部分移入 Discussion 而非 Results 核心位置；\\n\\\n  (2) perturbation control 需报告 net effect (Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb)，C1 写\\n\\\n  \\    \\\"ambiguity causes violations substantially beyond general prompt sensitivity\\\"\\\n  \\ 而非 \\\"ambiguity-specific\\\"；\\n(3) C5 failure mode 跨模型一致性从 \\\"5/6 types converge\\\"\\\n  \\ 改为\\n    \\\"majority of types show consistent signatures, with model-dependent variation\\\n  \\ in 2 types\\\"。\\nC4 model×type interaction 仍是 star finding 但需 soften auth_scope\\\n  \\ 的 safety training 解释——\\n极差缩小至 42pp 意味着可能是 prompt format 差异而非纯粹 training 差异。\\n\\\n  Title 从 \\\"Differential Vulnerability Profiles\\\" 微调为 \\\"Differential Vulnerability\\\n  \\ Patterns\\\"（避免暗示稳定 profile）。\\n仍可冲 EMNLP，但需补充 1-2 个 robustness check（per-type bootstrap\\\n  \\ stability、additional perturbation pairs）作为 appendix。\\n\"\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '生成 140 新 clause pairs（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical\n    +20, incompleteness +20），\n\n    验证全部 300 pairs 跨类型平衡性，混合 CP 标注格式。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    clauses_generated: 140\n    clauses_passing_first_round: 131\n    clauses_requiring_revision: 9\n    revision_breakdown: auth_scope 4, coreferential 3, lexical 1, incompleteness 1\n    total_validated_pairs: 300\n    cross_type_balance: 50/type, PASS\n    avg_disambiguation_tokens_spec: 34.2\n    avg_disambiguation_tokens_ling: 13.1\n    avg_disambiguation_tokens_per_type:\n      authorization_scope: 37.8\n      conditional_precedence: 29.4\n      incompleteness: 35.5\n      lexical: 14.6\n      coreferential: 8.2\n      scopal: 16.4\n    cp_format_mix: 28 labeled (56%), 22 unlabeled (44%)\n  result_rationale: \"auth_scope 和 coreferential 是全新类型，设计匹配对时困难最大。auth_scope 的 4 个返修\\\n    \\ clause \\n主要因为 unambiguous 版本的权限边界描述仍有隐含模糊（如 \\\"authorized personnel\\\" 改为 \\\"Level-2\\\n    \\ support agents\\\" \\n但未指定 Level-2 的具体权限范围）。coreferential 的 3 个返修因 RC attachment\\\n    \\ 消歧改动过大导致 \\n句法结构明显不同，需重写以保持表面相似度。disambiguation token delta 在 spec-layer 偏高（34.2\\\n    \\ vs 13.1），\\n这是 spec-layer 类型的固有特征——消歧需要添加完整的条件子句而非单词替换，但也构成潜在的 information \\n\\\n    asymmetry confound，需在 Method 中报告。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Per-Type Clause Generation Summary\n    content: '| Type                 | Existing | New | Revised | Final | Avg Disambig\n      Tokens |\n\n      |----------------------|----------|-----|---------|-------|---------------------|\n\n      | authorization_scope  | 0        | 50  | 4       | 50    | 37.8                |\n\n      | conditional_prec.    | 50       | 0   | 0       | 50    | 29.4                |\n\n      | incompleteness       | 30       | 20  | 1       | 50    | 35.5                |\n\n      | lexical              | 30       | 20  | 1       | 50    | 14.6                |\n\n      | coreferential        | 0        | 50  | 3       | 50    | 8.2                 |\n\n      | scopal               | 50       | 0   | 0       | 50    | 16.4                |\n\n      | **Total**            | **160**  |**140**|**9**  |**300**| 23.7                |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Token delta distribution per type (box plot): spec-layer types cluster at 29-38\n    tokens, ling-layer at 8-16 tokens, with auth_scope showing highest variance'\n  analysis: \"生成完成但暴露两个 methodological point：(1) spec-layer disambiguation tokens 显著高于\\\n    \\ ling-layer \\n(34.2 vs 13.1, t-test p<0.001)，需作为 control variable 纳入 logistic\\\n    \\ regression；\\n(2) auth_scope 返修率最高 (8%)，反映该类型的 ambiguous/unambiguous 边界最模糊——\\n\\\n    这本身也预示了该类型在实验中的高变异性。CP format mixing (56/44 labeled/unlabeled) \\n符合 Reviewer 建议。\\n\"\n- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_001b\n  description: 'Coreferential + auth_scope 各 5 clauses × 2 conditions × gpt-5.4 =\n    20 episodes。\n\n    验证新类型基本可行性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 20\n    coreferential_amb_violations: 2/5 (40%)\n    coreferential_unamb_violations: 0/5 (0%)\n    auth_scope_amb_violations: 3/5 (60%)\n    auth_scope_unamb_violations: 1/5 (20%)\n    clauses_flagged_for_revision: 1\n    flagged_clause_type: 'auth_scope unambiguous #3'\n    api_cost_usd: 1.8\n  result_rationale: \"Coreferential 表现符合预期：amb 40% 低于其他类型的 pilot 数据（scopal 51.7%, incomp\\\n    \\ 53.3%），\\n因为部分 coreferential 歧义可通过 tool response 中的实体信息部分消歧（disambiguation channel\\\n    \\ 存在）。\\nUnamb 0% 证明 control condition 干净。\\nAuth_scope amb 60% 符合 GPT-5.4 在该类型上的高\\\n    \\ vulnerability 预期。但 unamb 1/5=20% \\n是问题——clause #3 的 \\\"unambiguous\\\" 版本写了 \\\"\\\n    Level-2 support agents may process returns \\nfor standard items\\\"，但 agent 仍将 \\\"\\\n    standard items\\\" 的范围理解错误（边界虽明确但 agent \\n未正确遵守）。这不是 ambiguity 问题而是 instruction-following\\\n    \\ 问题，但会抬高 baseline。\\n需要修改该 clause 使 unambiguous 版本的边界更加 explicit（如添加 \\\"standard\\\n    \\ items only, \\nexcluding customized and clearance items\\\"）。\\nN=5 variance 极大，不做统计推断，仅做\\\n    \\ sanity check。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Mini-Pilot Results by Type and Condition\n    content: '| Type              | Condition   | Violations | Rate | Notes           |\n\n      |-------------------|-------------|------------|------|-----------------|\n\n      | coreferential     | ambiguous   | 2/5        | 40%  | expected range  |\n\n      | coreferential     | unambiguous | 0/5        | 0%   | clean control   |\n\n      | auth_scope        | ambiguous   | 3/5        | 60%  | expected high   |\n\n      | auth_scope        | unambiguous | 1/5        | 20%  | clause #3 issue |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: \"两类型基本可行。Coreferential 的低 violation rate 与 disambiguation channel 假说一致。\\n\\\n    Auth_scope clause #3 需返修后重跑验证。整体判定 GO，但 auth_scope baseline leakage \\n问题需在全量实验前解决——如果\\\n    \\ 10% 的 unamb clause 有类似问题，会系统性压低 binary effect。\\n\"\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n    = 1,800 episodes。\n\n    Cross-judge evaluation。Claude via OpenRouter proxy。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1797\n    episodes_failed_retry: 3\n    gpt54_episodes: 600\n    gpt41_episodes: 599\n    claude_episodes: 598\n    gpt54_amb_violation_rate: 0.383\n    gpt54_unamb_violation_rate: 0.068\n    gpt54_binary_effect_pp: 31.5\n    gpt41_amb_violation_rate: 0.36\n    gpt41_unamb_violation_rate: 0.062\n    gpt41_binary_effect_pp: 29.8\n    claude_amb_violation_rate: 0.257\n    claude_unamb_violation_rate: 0.048\n    claude_binary_effect_pp: 20.9\n    cross_judge_pairs: gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1; gpt-4.1+Claude judged by gpt-5.4\n    api_cost_usd: 387\n    runtime_hours: 14.2\n  result_rationale: \"三个 API 模型均显示显著 binary effect，但 Claude 效应量明显低于 GPT 系列（+20.9pp\\\n    \\ vs ~30pp），\\n缩水幅度超过 best tier 的 25.7pp 约 5pp。原因：(1) 50-clause/type 全量集包含了更多 \\\"\\\n    边缘\\\" \\ncases，pilot 的 10-clause 子集偏向了效应最显著的 exemplars；(2) Claude 在 auth_scope 上\\\n    \\ \\n极其稳健（amb 仅 14%），拉低了整体 ambiguous violation rate；(3) 天然的 API sampling variance\\\n    \\ \\n在单次 full run 中可能偏低方向（plan_006 ICC 数据显示 ±5-8pp per-clause variance 是正常的）。\\n\\\n    GPT-5.4 和 GPT-4.1 之间差异较小（38.3% vs 36.0%），不如 best tier 中的 41.0% vs 40.7% 分离度高。\\n\\\n    3 个 episode 因 API timeout 失败（2 个 Claude via OpenRouter, 1 个 GPT-4.1），未 retry \\n\\\n    以保持时间窗口一致性。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Per-Model Summary (API Models)\n    content: '| Model            | N_amb | N_unamb | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect\n      (pp) | p-value   |\n\n      |------------------|-------|---------|----------|------------|-------------|-----------|\n\n      | gpt-5.4          | 300   | 300     | 38.3%    | 6.8%       | +31.5       |\n      <10^-14   |\n\n      | gpt-4.1          | 300   | 299     | 36.0%    | 6.2%       | +29.8       |\n      <10^-13   |\n\n      | claude-sonnet-4-6| 299   | 299     | 25.7%    | 4.8%       | +20.9       |\n      <10^-8    |\n\n      | **API pooled**   |**899**|**898**  | **33.4%**| **5.9%**   |**+27.5**    |\n      **<10^-20**|\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-model violin plot of per-clause violation rates (ambiguous condition): Claude\n    distribution left-shifted, GPT-5.4 and GPT-4.1 overlapping with heavier right\n    tails'\n  analysis: \"API 模型数据收集完成。Claude 的低 vulnerability 主要来自 auth_scope（14%，vs GPT-5.4 56%），\\n\\\n    验证了 Anthropic 的 safety training 对授权边界类型有特殊效果。但 Claude effect 缩水至 20.9pp \\n意味着\\\n    \\ paper 中需报告 per-model range [20.9, 31.5] 而非仅报告 pooled value。\\nCross-judge asymmetry（Claude\\\n    \\ 由 gpt-5.4 判定而非反向）需在 Method 中 disclose。\\n\"\n- name: full_study_opensource\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models via OpenRouter (Qwen3-235B,\n    DeepSeek-V3) = 1,200 episodes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1196\n    episodes_failed_retry: 4\n    qwen3_episodes: 599\n    deepseek_episodes: 597\n    qwen3_amb_violation_rate: 0.333\n    qwen3_unamb_violation_rate: 0.076\n    qwen3_binary_effect_pp: 25.7\n    deepseek_amb_violation_rate: 0.433\n    deepseek_unamb_violation_rate: 0.089\n    deepseek_binary_effect_pp: 34.4\n    api_cost_usd: 142\n    runtime_hours: 11.8\n  result_rationale: \"DeepSeek 显示最高整体 vulnerability（43.3%），效应量缩水约 4.6pp（best tier 39.0pp\\\n    \\ → 34.4pp），\\n但仍是 5 模型中最大 effect。DeepSeek 在所有 6 类型上均高于 35%，验证了其 \\\"uniform vulnerability\\\"\\\n    \\ \\npattern——safety training 缺乏 type-specific 针对性。\\nQwen3 效应量缩水最大（best tier 32.4pp\\\n    \\ → 25.7pp, -6.7pp），原因：(1) Qwen3 在 auth_scope 上 \\n表现出乎意料地好（20%，接近 Claude 的 14%），拉低了\\\n    \\ spec-layer 平均；(2) 但在 incompleteness \\n上很高（54%），形成与 Claude 类似但更极端的 \\\"auth-robust,\\\n    \\ incomp-vulnerable\\\" profile。\\nQwen3 的 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%），部分解释了较小的 effect\\\n    \\ size。\\n4 个 episode 因 OpenRouter rate limiting 失败（3 Qwen3, 1 DeepSeek）。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Per-Model Summary (Open-Source Models)\n    content: '| Model           | N_amb | N_unamb | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect\n      (pp) | p-value   |\n\n      |-----------------|-------|---------|----------|------------|-------------|-----------|\n\n      | Qwen3-235B      | 300   | 299     | 33.3%    | 7.6%       | +25.7       |\n      <10^-8    |\n\n      | DeepSeek-V3     | 299   | 298     | 43.3%    | 8.9%       | +34.4       |\n      <10^-14   |\n\n      | **OS pooled**   |**599**|**597**  | **38.3%**| **8.3%**   |**+30.1**    |\n      **<10^-18**|\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Open-source vs API model comparison: bar chart of per-model ambiguous violation\n    rates with 95% CI, showing DeepSeek highest, Claude lowest'\n  analysis: \"Open-source 模型数据验证了 model diversity 的价值：Qwen3 的 auth_scope robustness\\\n    \\ 挑战了 \\n\\\"仅 proprietary 模型有 auth 训练\\\" 的简单叙事，DeepSeek 的 uniform vulnerability 提供了\\\n    \\ \\n\\\"safety training blind spot\\\" 假说的负面证据（或正面——取决于是否将其视为缺乏任何 type-specific training）。\\n\\\n    两模型的 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%, 8.9% vs API 模型 4.8-6.8%），可能反映 open-source 模型 \\n在一般\\\n    \\ instruction-following 上略弱。\\n\"\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '对 plan_002 + plan_003 合计 ~2,993 episodes 的全量统计分析：C1 binary effect,\n    C2 type hierarchy,\n\n    C3 layer effect, C4 model×type interaction, 含 power analysis, TOST, logistic regression,\n    inter-model agreement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes_analyzed: 2993\n    c1_pooled_effect_pp: 28.7\n    c1_pooled_bootstrap_ci: '[25.8, 31.5]'\n    c1_mcnemar_OR: 11.2\n    c1_mcnemar_OR_ci: '[7.9, 15.8]'\n    c1_mcnemar_p: <0.0001\n    c1_per_model_effects_pp:\n      claude: 20.9\n      qwen3: 25.7\n      gpt41: 29.8\n      gpt54: 31.5\n      deepseek: 34.4\n    c1_all_models_significant: true\n    c1_all_types_significant: true\n    c1_logistic_condition_amb_coef: 1.95\n    c1_logistic_condition_amb_z: 16.3\n    c1_logistic_condition_amb_OR: 7.03\n    c2_omnibus_chi2: 19.8\n    c2_omnibus_p: 0.0013\n    c2_omnibus_df: 5\n    c2_cramers_V: 0.115\n    c2_actual_power: 0.971\n    c2_MDE_V: 0.093\n    c2_type_rates_pooled_amb:\n      incompleteness: 46.4%\n      lexical: 36.4%\n      authorization_scope: 36.0%\n      scopal: 34.4%\n      conditional_precedence: 32.8%\n      coreferential: 27.2%\n    c2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: 19.2\n    c2_3tier_structure: 'High: incomp (46.4%) | Mid: lex/auth/scopal/CP (32.8-36.4%)\n      | Low: coref (27.2%)'\n    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 6/15\n    c2_tost_15pp_nonequivalent_pairs: 9/15\n    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 2/15\n    c2_tost_10pp_nonequivalent_pairs: 13/15\n    c2_holm_significant_pairs: incomp-coref (p<0.001), incomp-CP (p=0.002)\n    c3_spec_rate: 38.4%\n    c3_ling_rate: 32.7%\n    c3_layer_gap_pp: 5.7\n    c3_pooled_chi2: 4.82\n    c3_pooled_p: 0.028\n    c3_pooled_V: 0.057\n    c3_pooled_OR: 1.28\n    c3_pooled_OR_ci: '[1.03, 1.59]'\n    c3_within_judge_gpt41_group_gap_pp: 7.0\n    c3_within_judge_gpt41_group_p: 0.11\n    c3_within_judge_gpt54_group_gap_pp: 4.2\n    c3_within_judge_gpt54_group_p: 0.22\n    c3_per_model_layer_gaps_pp:\n      gpt54: '+12.7'\n      gpt41: '+10.7'\n      claude: '+2.0'\n      deepseek: '+1.3'\n      qwen3: '0.0'\n    c3_verdict: suggestive tendency, NOT confirmed\n    c4_model_main_chi2_ambonly: 22.4\n    c4_model_main_p_ambonly: 0.00017\n    c4_model_main_V_ambonly: 0.122\n    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 42\n    c4_auth_scope_min: Claude 14%\n    c4_auth_scope_max: GPT-5.4 56%\n    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n    c4_incomp_min: Claude 34%\n    c4_incomp_max: Qwen3 54%\n    c4_cp_range_pp: 4\n    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.33\n    c4_fleiss_interpretation: fair agreement\n    c4_lr_interaction_chi2: 36.8\n    c4_lr_interaction_p: 0.012\n    c4_per_model_type_chi2:\n      gpt54: χ²=18.2, p=0.003, V=0.25\n      qwen3: χ²=14.2, p=0.014, V=0.22\n      claude: χ²=9.8, p=0.08, V=0.18\n      gpt41: χ²=8.2, p=0.15, V=0.17\n      deepseek: χ²=4.8, p=0.44, V=0.13\n    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.018\n    logistic_token_delta_z: 2.81\n    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.005\n    logistic_model_aic_delta: -42.3\n    intermodel_same_interpretation_rate: 0.24\n    intermodel_systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.22\n  result_rationale: \"C1 效应量从 best tier +34.0pp 缩至 +28.7pp，主要因为：(a) Claude 效应缩水最大（+25.7→+20.9pp），\\n\\\n    其 auth_scope 极低 vulnerability 在 50-clause 全量集中更加显著地拉低 pooled value；\\n(b) Qwen3\\\n    \\ 效应也偏低（+25.7pp），部分因 unamb baseline 偏高（7.6%）；(c) 全量 50-clause 集\\n比 pilot 10-clause\\\n    \\ 集多了更多 \\\"弱效应\\\" exemplars。但所有 5 模型 × 6 类型组合均显著 (p<0.001)，\\n核心 claim 完全成立。OR=11.2\\\n    \\ 虽低于 best tier 15.1 但仍属 very large effect。\\n\\nC2 V=0.115 低于 best tier 0.137，但仍高于\\\n    \\ MDE=0.093（power=0.971），type effect 真实存在\\n但较小。3-tier 结构中 mid-tier 更加压缩（32.8-36.4%\\\n    \\ 仅 3.6pp 极差 vs best tier 36.8-42.8% 的 6pp），\\n意味着 mid-tier 内部类型近乎不可区分。只有 incomp-coref\\\n    \\ 和 incomp-CP 在 Holm 校正后显著。\\nTOST 在 ±15pp 下 6/15 等价 (vs best tier 8/15) 反映整体分离度下降。\\n\\\n    \\nC3 pooled p=0.028 形式上显著但 within-judge 两个子组均不显著 (p=0.11, p=0.22)。\\n根本原因：layer\\\n    \\ gap 高度 model-dependent——GPT 模型 +10-13pp，Claude/DeepSeek/Qwen3 ≤ +2pp。\\ngpt-5.4\\\n    \\ judged group 包含 GPT-4.1+Claude+Qwen3（后两者 gap≈0），所以子组效应被稀释。\\npooled 显著性可能反映 between-judge\\\n    \\ variance 而非真实 layer effect。必须降级为 \\\"suggestive\\\"。\\n\\nC4 auth_scope 极差 42pp (vs\\\n    \\ best tier 52pp) 因 GPT-5.4 从 64%→56%、DeepSeek 从 60%→48%。\\n缩小的极差削弱了 \\\"safety training\\\n    \\ differentially mitigates auth_scope\\\" 的论证力度——\\n8pp 的缩小可能意味着 pilot 阶段 GPT-5.4\\\n    \\ 高估了（sampling variance），也可能意味着 \\nprompt format 差异（API 参数、system prompt 细微不同）在\\\n    \\ pilot 中被放大。需要 soften \\n因果解释。Claude 的 per-model type χ² 从显著 (p=0.003) 降至 borderline\\\n    \\ (p=0.08)，\\n因为 Claude 在全量集中 auth_scope 14% 虽仍最低但其他类型也偏低（26-38%），整体 profile \\n\\\n    更\\\"均匀地低\\\"而非\\\"选择性低\\\"。GPT-4.1 也失去了显著性 (p=0.15)。\\nFleiss κ=0.33 意味着模型间对具体 clause\\\n    \\ 的 violation/no-violation 判定只有 fair agreement，\\nbinary effect 是 universal 的但\\\n    \\ WHICH clauses trigger violations 高度 model-dependent。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: C1 Per-Model Binary Effect Summary\n    content: '| Model      | Amb Rate | Unamb Rate | Effect (pp) | Bootstrap 95% CI  |\n      McNemar p  |\n\n      |------------|----------|------------|-------------|-------------------|------------|\n\n      | Claude     | 25.7%    | 4.8%       | +20.9       | [+16.2, +25.8]    | <10^-8     |\n\n      | Qwen3      | 33.3%    | 7.6%       | +25.7       | [+21.0, +31.4]    | <10^-8     |\n\n      | GPT-4.1    | 36.0%    | 6.2%       | +29.8       | [+24.8, +34.9]    | <10^-13    |\n\n      | GPT-5.4    | 38.3%    | 6.8%       | +31.5       | [+26.2, +36.8]    | <10^-14    |\n\n      | DeepSeek   | 43.3%    | 8.9%       | +34.4       | [+29.5, +39.3]    | <10^-14    |\n\n      | **Pooled** |**35.5%** | **6.9%**   |**+28.7**    |**[+25.8, +31.5]** |**<10^-30**\n      |\n\n      '\n  - title: C2 Per-Type Violation Rates (Ambiguous Condition, Pooled Across 5 Models)\n    content: '| Tier | Type                 | Rate  | 95% CI        | vs Coref (pp)\n      | Holm p  |\n\n      |------|----------------------|-------|---------------|---------------|---------|\n\n      | High | incompleteness       | 46.4% | [42.2, 50.6]  | +19.2         | <0.001  |\n\n      | Mid  | lexical              | 36.4% | [32.3, 40.5]  | +9.2          | 0.068   |\n\n      | Mid  | authorization_scope  | 36.0% | [31.9, 40.1]  | +8.8          | 0.078   |\n\n      | Mid  | scopal               | 34.4% | [30.3, 38.5]  | +7.2          | 0.14    |\n\n      | Mid  | conditional_prec.    | 32.8% | [28.7, 36.9]  | +5.6          | 0.27    |\n\n      | Low  | coreferential        | 27.2% | [23.3, 31.1]  | ref           | ref     |\n\n      '\n  - title: C4 Model × Type Interaction Matrix (Ambiguous Condition Violation Rates)\n    content: '| Type                | GPT-5.4 | GPT-4.1 | Claude | Qwen3 | DeepSeek\n      | Range |\n\n      |---------------------|---------|---------|--------|-------|----------|-------|\n\n      | authorization_scope | 56%     | 42%     | 14%    | 20%   | 48%      | 42pp  |\n\n      | conditional_prec.   | 34%     | 32%     | 32%    | 32%   | 34%      | 2pp   |\n\n      | incompleteness      | 44%     | 50%     | 34%    | 54%   | 50%      | 20pp  |\n\n      | lexical             | 38%     | 30%     | 26%    | 40%   | 48%      | 22pp  |\n\n      | coreferential       | 20%     | 28%     | 20%    | 30%   | 38%      | 18pp  |\n\n      | scopal              | 38%     | 34%     | 28%    | 30%   | 42%      | 14pp  |\n\n      | **Model avg**       |**38.3%**|**36.0%**|**25.7%**|**34.3%**|**43.3%**|   |\n\n      '\n  - title: C3 Per-Model Layer Gap\n    content: '| Model    | Spec-Layer Avg | Ling-Layer Avg | Gap (pp) | Direction        |\n\n      |----------|----------------|----------------|----------|------------------|\n\n      | GPT-5.4  | 44.7%          | 32.0%          | +12.7    | spec > ling      |\n\n      | GPT-4.1  | 41.3%          | 30.7%          | +10.7    | spec > ling      |\n\n      | Claude   | 26.7%          | 24.7%          | +2.0     | negligible       |\n\n      | DeepSeek | 44.0%          | 42.7%          | +1.3     | negligible       |\n\n      | Qwen3    | 33.3%          | 33.3%          | 0.0      | no difference    |\n\n      |**Pooled**| **38.4%**      | **32.7%**      | **+5.7** | **suggestive**   |\n\n      '\n  - title: Logistic Regression Coefficients (Full Model)\n    content: '| Predictor          | Coef   | SE    | z     | p       | OR    |\n\n      |--------------------|--------|-------|-------|---------|-------|\n\n      | condition_amb      | 1.950  | 0.120 | 16.3  | <0.001  | 7.03  |\n\n      | model_gpt41        | 0.550  | 0.145 | 3.79  | <0.001  | 1.73  |\n\n      | model_gpt54        | 0.620  | 0.148 | 4.19  | <0.001  | 1.86  |\n\n      | model_qwen3        | 0.420  | 0.144 | 2.92  | 0.004   | 1.52  |\n\n      | model_deepseek     | 0.820  | 0.147 | 5.58  | <0.001  | 2.27  |\n\n      | type_auth_scope    | 0.420  | 0.168 | 2.50  | 0.012   | 1.52  |\n\n      | type_cp            | 0.280  | 0.165 | 1.70  | 0.089   | 1.32  |\n\n      | type_incomp        | 0.850  | 0.167 | 5.09  | <0.001  | 2.34  |\n\n      | type_lexical       | 0.440  | 0.169 | 2.60  | 0.009   | 1.55  |\n\n      | type_scopal        | 0.330  | 0.165 | 2.00  | 0.046   | 1.39  |\n\n      | token_delta        | 0.018  | 0.006 | 2.81  | 0.005   | 1.02  |\n\n      | model×type (LR)    | —      | —     | —     | 0.012   | —     |\n\n      '\n  - title: TOST Equivalence Summary\n    content: '| Margin | Equivalent | Non-Equivalent | Indeterminate |\n\n      |--------|------------|----------------|---------------|\n\n      | ±15pp  | 6/15       | 9/15           | 0/15          |\n\n      | ±10pp  | 2/15       | 13/15          | 0/15          |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2 (Forest plot): Per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, pooled\n    across 5 models. Incompleteness stands out; mid-tier cluster visible; coreferential\n    lowest but CI still excludes 0'\n  - 'Figure 3 (Heatmap): 5-model × 6-type violation rate matrix. Color gradient yellow-to-red.\n    Auth_scope column shows dramatic cross-model variation; incompleteness row uniformly\n    dark; CP row uniformly mid-range'\n  - 'Figure: Layer gap by model — diverging bar chart showing GPT models positive,\n    Claude/DeepSeek/Qwen3 near zero, illustrating model-dependence of C3'\n  analysis: \"C1 robust but effect smaller than anticipated. Paper 需报告 pooled +28.7pp\\\n    \\ 和 per-model range \\n[+20.9, +34.4]，避免 cherry-picking pooled value。Claude 的 +20.9pp\\\n    \\ 虽是最低但仍 massive \\n(OR>4, p<10^-8)。\\nC2 3-tier 结构成立但 mid-tier 压缩。TOST 显示类型不可互换（±10pp\\\n    \\ 仅 2/15 等价），\\n但精细排序不可靠。Paper 应强调 incomp 的 outlier 地位和 coref 的 low-end boundary\\\n    \\ case，\\n不要细排 mid-tier 内部顺序。\\nC3 必须降级。pooled p=0.028 仅反映大样本效应，within-judge 不显著说明\\\n    \\ 5.7pp 的 gap \\n可能 partly artifactual。建议移入 Discussion §7 作为 \\\"observed pattern\\\"\\\n    \\ 而非 Results §5 \\n的 standalone finding。Layer gap 的 model-dependence 反而是有价值的 C4\\\n    \\ 支持证据。\\nC4 是 star finding。auth_scope 42pp 极差仍然 dramatic，但需 soften 表述为 \\n\\\"consistent\\\n    \\ with differential safety training effects, though prompt format sensitivity\\\n    \\ cannot be excluded\\\"。\\nFleiss κ=0.33 是重要发现——models agree on WHETHER ambiguity\\\n    \\ hurts but disagree on WHICH clauses。\\n\"\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '从 violation traces 中抽样 ~360 条（5 models × 6 types × ~12 traces/cell），\n\n    分类 failure modes，分析跨模型/跨类型一致性，量化 Ambiguity Blindness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces_analyzed: 358\n    traces_per_model:\n      gpt54: 78\n      gpt41: 74\n      claude: 42\n      qwen3: 68\n      deepseek: 96\n    pooled_failure_modes:\n      assumption_based_action: 31.3%\n      scope_misapplication: 27.4%\n      unauthorized_escalation: 23.5%\n      arbitrary_rule_selection: 9.2%\n      conservative_refusal: 5.3%\n      other: 3.4%\n    types_with_consistent_dominant_mode: 4\n    types_with_divergent_modes: 2\n    consistent_types: auth_scope (unauthorized_escalation), incompleteness (assumption_based_action),\n      scopal (scope_misapplication), CP (scope_misapplication+arbitrary_rule_selection)\n    divergent_types: lexical (GPT→assumption_based_action, OS→scope_misapplication),\n      coreferential (flat distribution, no dominant mode)\n    awareness_rate_pct: 9.2\n    awareness_range_by_model: '[4.8% (GPT-5.4), 14.3% (Claude)]'\n    surface_adoption_pct: 84.1\n    escalate_to_user_pct: 1.1\n    ling_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 36.2\n    spec_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 13.8\n    spec_layer_escalation_plus_assumption_pct: 62.4\n    airline_vs_retail_max_delta_pp: 14.2\n    airline_vs_retail_delta_type: unauthorized_escalation (retail 37.1% vs airline\n      22.9%)\n    coreferential_conservative_refusal_pct: 8.4\n    coreferential_n_traces: 28\n    cross_coding_n: 72\n    cross_coding_agreement_pct: 76.4\n    cross_coding_cohens_kappa: 0.548\n    gwets_AC1: 0.682\n  result_rationale: \"4/6 类型跨 5 模型一致（vs best tier 5/6），原因：\\n(1) auth_scope→unauthorized_escalation\\\n    \\ 在 Claude 上只有 ~7 条 traces（14% rate × 50 episodes），\\n    其中 45% 是 unauthorized_escalation、25%\\\n    \\ conservative_refusal——pattern 不同但 N 太小不影响\\n    overall consistency（4/5 模型仍以\\\n    \\ unauthorized_escalation 为主导）；\\n(2) incompleteness 和 scopal 的 failure mode 由\\\n    \\ ambiguity type 本身的结构决定（缺信息→猜测行动，\\n    scope 模糊→misapply scope），不依赖模型架构，故高度一致；\\n\\\n    (3) lexical 类型出现 model-family 分裂：GPT 系列将词汇歧义处理为信息缺口（assumption_based_action 60-68%），\\n\\\n    \\    open-source 模型（Qwen3, DeepSeek）更倾向 scope_misapplication（45-52%），可能反映 \\n \\\n    \\   training data 中对词汇多义性的不同处理策略。这是 median 档独有的发现——best tier 中\\n    只有 2 模型，未能检测到此\\\n    \\ family-level divergence；\\n(4) coreferential 仍无主导 failure mode（flat distribution），N=28\\\n    \\ traces 中 scope_misapplication 30%、\\n    assumption_based_action 25%、unauthorized_escalation\\\n    \\ 18%——三种模式均无法突出。\\n\\nAwareness rate 9.2% 高于 best tier GPT-5.4 的 4.1% 但符合范围，因为\\\n    \\ Claude 的 awareness 最高\\n（14.3%——其 RLHF 可能 implicitly 训练了更多 metacognitive hedging）。Surface\\\n    \\ adoption 84.1% \\n略低于 best tier 88%+，反映 5-model pool 中有更多 variance。\\n\\nCross-coding\\\n    \\ κ=0.548 低于 best tier 0.594，因为 5-model traces 引入了更多 edge cases（尤其 \\nQwen3 和 DeepSeek\\\n    \\ 的 failure mode 表述风格不同于 GPT 系列）。Gwet's AC1=0.682 好于 κ，\\n因为 kappa paradox 在 high-prevalence\\\n    \\ categories 中更严重。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Failure Mode × Type Distribution (Pooled Across 5 Models)\n    content: '| Type          | assumption | unauth_esc | scope_misapp | arb_rule\n      | conserv_ref | other |\n\n      |---------------|-----------|------------|--------------|----------|-------------|-------|\n\n      | auth_scope    | 15%       | 68%        | 8%           | 2%       | 4%          |\n      3%    |\n\n      | CP            | 22%       | 8%         | 35%          | 28%      | 4%          |\n      3%    |\n\n      | incompleteness| 60%       | 18%        | 10%          | 6%       | 3%          |\n      3%    |\n\n      | lexical       | 52%       | 6%         | 28%          | 6%       | 4%          |\n      4%    |\n\n      | coreferential | 25%       | 18%        | 30%          | 8%       | 12%         |\n      7%    |\n\n      | scopal        | 10%       | 5%         | 72%          | 6%       | 4%          |\n      3%    |\n\n      '\n  - title: Lexical Failure Mode by Model Family (Divergent Type)\n    content: '| Model Family  | assumption_based | scope_misapp | other modes |\n\n      |---------------|-----------------|--------------|-------------|\n\n      | GPT-5.4       | 64%             | 18%          | 18%         |\n\n      | GPT-4.1       | 60%             | 22%          | 18%         |\n\n      | Claude        | 58%             | 24%          | 18%         |\n\n      | Qwen3         | 38%             | 45%          | 17%         |\n\n      | DeepSeek      | 35%             | 52%          | 13%         |\n\n      '\n  - title: Ambiguity Blindness Metrics by Model\n    content: '| Model    | Awareness | Surface Adoption | Escalate to User |\n\n      |----------|-----------|------------------|------------------|\n\n      | GPT-5.4  | 4.8%      | 88.2%            | 0.6%             |\n\n      | GPT-4.1  | 10.2%     | 83.7%            | 1.4%             |\n\n      | Claude   | 14.3%     | 78.4%            | 2.1%             |\n\n      | Qwen3    | 8.6%      | 84.2%            | 0.8%             |\n\n      | DeepSeek | 5.9%      | 86.8%            | 0.4%             |\n\n      |**Pooled**| **9.2%**  | **84.1%**        | **1.1%**         |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5 (Stacked bar): Per-type failure mode distribution, showing type-diagnostic\n    signatures — auth_scope dominated by red (unauthorized_escalation), incompleteness\n    by blue (assumption_based_action), scopal by green (scope_misapplication)'\n  - 'Figure 6 (Split panel): Lexical failure modes by model family — left panel GPT-family\n    (assumption dominant), right panel OS-family (scope_misapplication dominant),\n    illustrating the 2-type divergence'\n  - 'Figure 7 (Annotated trace pair): CP trace showing explicit conflict detection\n    (''I notice rules A and B appear to conflict'') vs scopal trace showing zero awareness\n    and surface scope adoption'\n  analysis: \"C5 核心发现（type-specific signatures + Ambiguity Blindness）成立，但跨模型一致性需 soften。\\n\\\n    Paper 表述从 \\\"5/6 types converge\\\" 改为 \\\"4/6 types show consistent dominant failure\\\n    \\ modes across \\nall 5 models; lexical type shows a model-family split (GPT →\\\n    \\ assumption, OS → scope misapplication); \\ncoreferential shows no dominant mode\\\n    \\ reflecting diverse resolution strategies\\\"。\\nLexical 的 model-family split 是\\\n    \\ median 档的独有洞察——可以在 Discussion 中讨论 training data \\ncomposition 如何影响 failure mode，但不应\\\n    \\ overclaim 因果关系。\\nAmbiguity Blindness 数据显示 Claude 的 awareness 最高 (14.3%)，与其最低\\\n    \\ violation rate 一致——\\n但不能推断因果（可能是 RLHF 导致更多 hedging 而非真正的 ambiguity detection）。\\n\\\n    Cross-coding κ=0.548 需在 paper 中 report 并 caveat：\\\"automated coding shows moderate\\\n    \\ agreement; \\nfine-grained per-type percentages should be interpreted as approximate。\\\"\\\n    \\n\"\n- name: reliability_test\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '30 representative clauses (5/type) × 3 replicates × 2 conditions ×\n    2 API models = 360 episodes。\n\n    计算 ICC 评估 per-clause violation rate 的 test-retest reliability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 358\n    episodes_complete: 355\n    episodes_pending_judgment: 3\n    overall_ICC: 0.882\n    overall_ICC_ci: '[0.842, 0.915]'\n    binary_ICC: 0.814\n    binary_ICC_ci: '[0.758, 0.860]'\n    per_model_ICC:\n      gpt54: 0.889\n      gpt41: 0.875\n    per_type_ICC:\n      scopal: 0.952\n      lexical: 0.938\n      coreferential: 0.924\n      authorization_scope: 0.834\n      conditional_precedence: 0.821\n      incompleteness: 0.792\n    per_layer_ICC:\n      ling_layer_avg: 0.938\n      spec_layer_avg: 0.816\n    bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp: 8.2\n  result_rationale: \"Overall ICC=0.882 (good) 略低于 best tier 0.919（excellent），因为：\\n\\\n    (1) 30-clause 子集中 spec-layer clauses 的 replicate variance 较高——incompleteness 的某些\\\n    \\ \\n    clauses 在 3 次 replicate 中分别得到 0/1/1 的 violation 结果（20%-80% swing），这是因为\\\n    \\ \\n    spec-layer ambiguity 缺乏外部消歧渠道，agent 每次 \\\"猜\\\" 不同方向；\\n(2) Ling-layer clauses（scopal,\\\n    \\ lexical, coref）ICC 全部 >0.92，因为其消歧路径（tool response、\\n    世界知识）在 replicate 间稳定；\\n\\\n    (3) Per-model ICC 接近（0.889 vs 0.875），说明 reliability 不依赖模型选择；\\n(4) Bootstrap CI\\\n    \\ 中位宽度 8.2pp 高于目标 <10pp，勉强 PASS——意味着 individual clause-level \\n    的 effect size\\\n    \\ 估计有 ~±4pp 不确定性，但 type-level 和 pooled 分析因聚合效应而更精确。\\nSpec-layer 低 ICC 是 Disambiguation\\\n    \\ Channel Framework 的直接预测——agent 对 spec-layer \\nambiguity 的响应更不可预测，因为没有 external\\\n    \\ signal 来锚定解读。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: ICC by Type and Layer\n    content: '| Layer | Type                | ICC   | 95% CI        | Interpretation\n      |\n\n      |-------|---------------------|-------|---------------|----------------|\n\n      | Ling  | scopal              | 0.952 | [0.912, 0.978]| excellent      |\n\n      | Ling  | lexical             | 0.938 | [0.892, 0.968]| excellent      |\n\n      | Ling  | coreferential       | 0.924 | [0.871, 0.960]| excellent      |\n\n      | Spec  | authorization_scope | 0.834 | [0.748, 0.904]| good           |\n\n      | Spec  | conditional_prec.   | 0.821 | [0.732, 0.893]| good           |\n\n      | Spec  | incompleteness      | 0.792 | [0.694, 0.873]| good           |\n\n      |       | **Overall**         |**0.882**|**[0.842, 0.915]**| **good**   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ICC forest plot by type: ling-layer types clustered at 0.92-0.95, spec-layer\n    at 0.79-0.83, clear layer separation visible'\n  analysis: \"Reliability 达到 good 水平但未达 excellent。Paper 可以报告 \\\"per-clause violation\\\n    \\ rates show \\ngood test-retest reliability (ICC=0.882)\\\"，但需在 Limitations 中提及\\\n    \\ spec-layer types 的 \\nlower reliability (ICC 0.79-0.83) 及其对 fine-grained per-clause\\\n    \\ inference 的限制。\\nICC 的 layer pattern (ling > spec) 是 Disambiguation Channel Framework\\\n    \\ 的 convergent evidence——\\n但在 median 档下只能作为 \\\"consistent with\\\" 而非 \\\"supports\\\"\\\n    。\\n\"\n- name: realism_validation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '比较 300 synthetic clause pairs 与 DRIP-R 自然 ambiguity 的语言学属性\n\n    (sentence length, parse depth, Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, token count)，\n\n    KS 检验判断分布差异。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_synthetic: 300\n    n_drip_r_reference: 187\n    ks_sentence_length_p: 0.041\n    ks_sentence_length_D: 0.142\n    ks_parse_depth_p: 0.34\n    ks_flesch_kincaid_p: 0.42\n    ks_ttr_p: 0.28\n    ks_token_count_p: 0.18\n    synthetic_mean_sentence_length: 22.3\n    drip_r_mean_sentence_length: 19.8\n    significant_properties: 1\n    nonsignificant_properties: 4\n  result_rationale: \"4/5 语言学属性无显著差异，说明 synthetic injection 没有创造系统性的表面特征偏差。\\nSentence\\\n    \\ length (p=0.041) 显著偏高 (22.3 vs 19.8 words)，原因：消歧操作（尤其 spec-layer \\ntypes 添加条件子句）使\\\n    \\ ambiguous 版本在移除消歧内容后仍保留了较复杂的句法结构。\\n这是一个 minor confound——更长的句子可能本身就更难处理，但 plan_004\\\n    \\ 的 logistic regression \\n已将 token_delta 作为 control variable（coef=0.018, p=0.005），显示其效应存在但远小于\\\n    \\ \\nambiguity condition 效应（coef=1.95）。\\nParse depth, readability, lexical diversity\\\n    \\ 和 token count 均在 DRIP-R 分布范围内，\\n表明 synthetic clauses 的整体语言复杂度与自然 policy ambiguity\\\n    \\ 一致。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Linguistic Property Comparison: Synthetic vs DRIP-R'\n    content: '| Property        | Synthetic (mean±sd) | DRIP-R (mean±sd) | KS D  |\n      KS p  | Sig?  |\n\n      |-----------------|---------------------|-------------------|-------|-------|-------|\n\n      | Sentence length | 22.3 ± 6.8         | 19.8 ± 5.4        | 0.142 | 0.041 |\n      *     |\n\n      | Parse depth     | 5.2 ± 1.9          | 5.0 ± 1.7         | 0.087 | 0.34  |\n      n.s.  |\n\n      | Flesch-Kincaid  | 11.4 ± 2.3         | 11.1 ± 2.1        | 0.078 | 0.42  |\n      n.s.  |\n\n      | TTR             | 0.68 ± 0.12        | 0.71 ± 0.11       | 0.092 | 0.28  |\n      n.s.  |\n\n      | Token count     | 28.7 ± 8.4         | 26.2 ± 7.1        | 0.103 | 0.18  |\n      n.s.  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Overlaid density plots for each property: synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange).\n    Only sentence length shows visible right-shift for synthetic'\n  analysis: \"Realism validation 整体 PASS。Sentence length 差异需在 Method §4 中 disclose：\\n\\\n    \\\"Synthetic clauses are marginally longer than naturally occurring policy ambiguities\\\n    \\ \\n(22.3 vs 19.8 words, KS p=0.041), reflecting the structural complexity required\\\n    \\ for \\nmatched-pair design. Token delta is included as a control variable in\\\n    \\ all regression analyses.\\\"\\n这不影响核心 claims 但是 honest reporting 的要求。\\n\"\n- name: judge_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '100 episodes stratified 抽样 × 2 human annotators 标注，\n\n    计算 LLM judge 与 human ground truth 的 precision/recall/F1，\n\n    per-severity-tier agreement，以及 20-30 failure mode traces 的人工验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n    n_human_annotators: 2\n    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.78\n    human_agreement_pct: 88.0\n    judge_human_binary_kappa: 0.74\n    judge_human_binary_F1: 0.87\n    judge_human_binary_precision: 0.89\n    judge_human_binary_recall: 0.87\n    judge_human_severity_kappa: 0.65\n    judge_human_severity_weighted_F1: 0.8\n    per_severity_F1:\n      no_violation: 0.9\n      minor_violation: 0.68\n      moderate_violation: 0.82\n      severe_violation: 0.88\n    most_confused_pair: minor_violation ↔ no_violation\n    confusion_rate_minor_as_none: 26.7% (4/15)\n    confusion_rate_none_as_minor: 13.3% (6/45)\n    n_failure_mode_traces_validated: 24\n    failure_mode_human_agreement_pct: 70.8\n    failure_mode_dominant_mode_match: 5/6 types match human coding\n  result_rationale: \"Human κ=0.78 (good) 达到 target ≥0.75，说明 violation 判定任务的人类 ground\\\n    \\ truth 可靠。\\nJudge binary F1=0.87 属于 adequate——大多数 \\\"明确 violation\\\"（如 unauthorized\\\n    \\ refund、越权操作）\\n和 \\\"明确 no-violation\\\" 被正确分类。但 minor violation tier F1=0.68 显著低于其他\\\n    \\ tier，\\n原因：(1) minor violations 本身定义模糊——\\\"slightly exceeding scope\\\" vs \\\"reasonable\\\n    \\ interpretation\\\" \\n的边界是主观的；(2) LLM judge 倾向于二值化（clear violation or not），对中间地带不敏感；\\n\\\n    (3) 15 个 human-labeled minor violations 中有 4 个被 judge 归为 no-violation（26.7% miss\\\n    \\ rate）。\\n\\nJudge-human κ=0.72 低于 judge-judge κ=0.91（来自 best tier framing 数据），正是\\\n    \\ plan_009 \\n被升级为 P0 的原因——judge 之间高度一致不等于 judge 准确。κ=0.72 的 gap 集中在 minor \\nviolations\\\n    \\ 和 auth_scope 的 boundary cases 上。\\n\\nSeverity tier 的不稳定性意味着 paper 应以 binary violation\\\n    \\ 为主要分析单元，\\nseverity-based 分析作为 supplementary。plan_005 的 failure mode coding 在\\\n    \\ 24 traces \\n人工验证中 70.8% agreement，5/6 types 的 dominant mode 与人工编码一致，\\n但 auth_scope\\\n    \\ 的 unauthorized_escalation vs inappropriate_action 边界仍模糊。\\n\\n整体判定：judge 在 binary\\\n    \\ level 可信（F1=0.87, κ=0.74），在 severity level 有 noise \\n但不影响核心 claims（C1-C4 均基于\\\n    \\ binary violation）。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Judge vs Human Confusion Matrix (Binary)\n    content: '|                    | Judge: No Violation | Judge: Violation |\n\n      |--------------------|---------------------|------------------|\n\n      | Human: No Violation| 39                  | 6                |\n\n      | Human: Violation   | 7                   | 48               |\n\n      | **Metrics**        | Precision=0.85      | Precision=0.89   |\n\n      |                    | **Binary κ=0.74**   | **Binary F1=0.87**|\n\n      '\n  - title: Per-Severity-Tier F1\n    content: '| Severity Tier    | N (human) | Precision | Recall | F1   | Primary\n      Confusion     |\n\n      |------------------|-----------|-----------|--------|------|-----------------------|\n\n      | No violation     | 45        | 0.85      | 0.87   | 0.90 | ← minor (6 cases)    |\n\n      | Minor violation  | 15        | 0.69      | 0.67   | 0.68 | → no_violation\n      (4)    |\n\n      | Moderate         | 22        | 0.82      | 0.82   | 0.82 | ↔ minor/severe\n      (4)   |\n\n      | Severe           | 18        | 0.88      | 0.89   | 0.88 | ← moderate (2)        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Confusion heatmap: 4×4 matrix showing strong diagonal with off-diagonal concentration\n    at minor↔no_violation boundary'\n  - 'Per-tier F1 bar chart with 95% Wilson CI: minor tier''s CI extends below 0.60,\n    other tiers well above 0.75'\n  analysis: \"Judge calibration 在 binary level 充分，在 severity level 有 caveat。Paper Method\\\n    \\ §4 报告：\\n\\\"LLM judge achieves good agreement with human ground truth (binary\\\n    \\ κ=0.74, F1=0.87). \\nSeverity-tier classification is less reliable (weighted\\\n    \\ F1=0.80), with minor violations \\nshowing the lowest agreement (F1=0.68). All\\\n    \\ primary analyses use binary violation classification.\\\"\\nMinor tier 的低 F1 不影响\\\n    \\ C1-C4（均基于 binary），但如果 paper 报告 severity 分布\\n（如 C5 error analysis 中区分 severity），需要\\\n    \\ caveat。\\nFailure mode validation (70.8% agreement, 24 traces) 虽 N 小但 5/6 dominant\\\n    \\ mode match \\n提供了基本的 face validity。完整的 human failure mode coding 留作 future work。\\n\"\n- name: perturbation_control\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '30 non-ambiguity perturbation pairs (15 synonym + 15 reorder) × 2\n    conditions × 3 API models = 180 episodes。\n\n    区分 ambiguity-specific harm 与 general prompt brittleness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 178\n    episodes_failed: 2\n    perturbation_types:\n      synonym: 15\n      reorder: 15\n    original_violation_rate: 0.067\n    perturbed_violation_rate: 0.139\n    delta_perturb_pp: 7.2\n    delta_perturb_ci: '[1.5, 12.9]'\n    delta_perturb_ci_contains_zero: false\n    ambiguity_delta_pp: 28.7\n    delta_net_pp: 21.5\n    ratio: 0.251\n    verdict: PASS+caveat\n    synonym_delta_pp: 5.8\n    reorder_delta_pp: 8.6\n    per_model_perturb_delta:\n      gpt54: 8.3\n      gpt41: 6.1\n      claude: 4.8\n  result_rationale: \"Δ_perturb=7.2pp 显著高于 best tier 的 3.33pp（CI 含 0），原因：\\n(1) Synonym\\\n    \\ substitution 中部分 \\\"同义词\\\" 实际有微妙语义差异——如 \\\"refund\\\" → \\\"reimbursement\\\" \\n    在\\\n    \\ policy 语境下可能暗示不同的处理流程，agent 对此敏感；\\n(2) Clause reordering 效应更大 (8.6pp vs synonym\\\n    \\ 5.8pp)，因为条件子句的顺序影响 agent \\n    的 salience weighting——先出现的条件被赋予更高权重（primacy effect），重排后某些\\\n    \\ \\n    exception 条件被 \\\"buried\\\" 导致 agent 忽略；\\n(3) GPT-5.4 对 perturbation 最敏感\\\n    \\ (8.3pp)，Claude 最稳健 (4.8pp)，与 overall \\n    prompt sensitivity 的 model ranking\\\n    \\ 一致。\\n\\nCI [1.5, 12.9] 不含 0 是关键 caveat——意味着非歧义性表面改动确实造成了 non-trivial \\n的 violation\\\n    \\ rate 增加。但 ratio=0.251 表明歧义效应 (28.7pp) 远大于一般敏感性 (7.2pp)，\\nnet effect 21.5pp 仍然\\\n    \\ massive。\\n\\n判定标准：5-10pp + ratio 0.15-0.30 = PASS+caveat。\\nPaper 需写：\\\"Ambiguity\\\n    \\ causes violations substantially beyond general prompt sensitivity \\n(Δ_net=21.5pp,\\\n    \\ 75% of the total ambiguity effect is ambiguity-specific), though non-ambiguity\\\n    \\ \\nperturbations also produce a small but significant increase (Δ_perturb=7.2pp,\\\n    \\ CI [1.5, 12.9]).\\\"\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Perturbation Control Summary\n    content: '| Metric                  | Value             | Interpretation              |\n\n      |-------------------------|-------------------|-----------------------------|\n\n      | Δ_perturb (overall)     | 7.2pp [1.5, 12.9] | significant, small          |\n\n      | Δ_perturb (synonym)     | 5.8pp             | borderline significant      |\n\n      | Δ_perturb (reorder)     | 8.6pp             | significant                 |\n\n      | Δ_ambiguity (from C1)   | 28.7pp            | massive                     |\n\n      | Δ_net                   | 21.5pp            | ambiguity-specific, large   |\n\n      | Ratio (perturb/ambig)   | 0.251             | 25% attributable to surface\n      |\n\n      | **Verdict**             | **PASS+caveat**   | C1 holds with net framing   |\n\n      '\n  - title: Per-Model Perturbation Sensitivity\n    content: '| Model    | Original Rate | Perturbed Rate | Δ_perturb (pp) |\n\n      |----------|---------------|----------------|-----------------|\n\n      | GPT-5.4  | 7.8%          | 16.1%          | +8.3            |\n\n      | GPT-4.1  | 6.3%          | 12.4%          | +6.1            |\n\n      | Claude   | 4.2%          | 9.0%           | +4.8            |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-bar comparison: Δ_perturb (7.2pp, gray), Δ_net (21.5pp, blue), total Δ_ambiguity\n    (28.7pp, red). Stacked to show composition. Error bars on each component.'\n  analysis: \"Perturbation control 是 median 档与 best tier 的关键差异。Best tier Δ_perturb=3.33pp\\\n    \\ (CI含0) \\n允许最强因果 claim；median 档 7.2pp (CI不含0) 要求 net effect framing。\\nPaper C1\\\n    \\ 的核心句从 \\\"ambiguity-specific causation\\\" 改为 \\\"ambiguity causes violations \\nsubstantially\\\n    \\ beyond general prompt sensitivity\\\"——这仍然是 strong claim 但诚实承认了 \\n一部分效应来自表面改动。Δ_net=21.5pp\\\n    \\ 仍是 agent safety 文献中最大的因果估计。\\nReorder > synonym 的发现本身是有意义的——可在 Discussion 中简短讨论\\\n    \\ clause ordering \\nas a prompt sensitivity factor。但不要 overclaim，这只有 15 pairs。\\n\\\n    建议：在 appendix 中补充额外 30 pairs（15 synonym + 15 reorder）以收窄 CI 至 <8pp width，\\n这是\\\n    \\ median 档需要的 robustness check 之一。\\n\"\n- name: classifier_poc\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC：在 300 clause pairs\n    上 fine-tune，\n\n    80/20 split，评估 held-out performance。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n    train_pairs: 240\n    test_pairs: 60\n    epochs: 5\n    learning_rate: 2.0e-05\n    test_binary_F1: 0.78\n    test_precision: 0.81\n    test_recall: 0.75\n    test_AUC: 0.85\n    per_type_F1:\n      incompleteness: 0.86\n      authorization_scope: 0.82\n      conditional_precedence: 0.76\n      lexical: 0.79\n      scopal: 0.73\n      coreferential: 0.68\n    gpu_hours_used: 2.4\n    training_cost_usd: 8.5\n  result_rationale: \"F1=0.78 是 reasonable PoC 性能但不突出，原因：\\n(1) 训练集仅 240 pairs，对 DeBERTa\\\n    \\ 来说是 very low resource setting；\\n(2) 每种类型仅 ~40 train examples，不足以学到 type-specific\\\n    \\ patterns；\\n(3) Per-type 性能与 disambiguation token delta 高度相关：incompleteness (35.5\\\n    \\ tokens avg edit) \\n    最容易检测（F1=0.86），因为 ambiguous 和 unambiguous 版本表面差异大；\\n\\\n    \\    coreferential (8.2 tokens) 最难（F1=0.68），因为差异仅在代词或 RC attachment 上。\\n\\nF1=0.78\\\n    \\ 足以证明 \\\"automated ambiguity detection is feasible\\\" 这一 practical implication，\\n\\\n    但不足以作为 standalone contribution。定位为 appendix PoC，标题可以是 \\n\\\"Preliminary: Toward\\\n    \\ Automated Policy Ambiguity Detection\\\"。\\nChantree et al. (2006) 的 nocuous ambiguity\\\n    \\ detector 在 controlled dataset 上 \\nprecision ~80%——与我们的 0.81 precision 可比，但他们的\\\n    \\ recall 更高 (~0.85)，\\n可能因为他们的 training set 更大且 domain-specific features 更多。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - title: Classifier PoC Results by Type\n    content: '| Type                | Test N | F1   | Precision | Recall | Avg Token\n      Δ |\n\n      |---------------------|--------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\n\n      | incompleteness      | 10     | 0.86 | 0.88      | 0.84   | 35.5        |\n\n      | authorization_scope | 10     | 0.82 | 0.84      | 0.80   | 37.8        |\n\n      | lexical             | 10     | 0.79 | 0.82      | 0.76   | 14.6        |\n\n      | conditional_prec.   | 10     | 0.76 | 0.78      | 0.74   | 29.4        |\n\n      | scopal              | 10     | 0.73 | 0.75      | 0.71   | 16.4        |\n\n      | coreferential       | 10     | 0.68 | 0.72      | 0.65   | 8.2         |\n\n      | **Overall**         | **60** |**0.78**|**0.81** |**0.75**| 23.7        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - ROC curve (AUC=0.85) with per-type operating points marked, showing incompleteness\n    near top-left corner and coreferential closer to diagonal\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-type F1 vs avg disambiguation token delta, showing strong positive\n    correlation (r=0.91)'\n  analysis: \"PoC 成功 demonstrate feasibility。F1 与 token delta 的 r=0.91 相关性本身是有趣的发现——\\n\\\n    说明 classifier 主要依赖 surface-level 信号（信息量差异）而非深层语义理解。\\n这暗示更好的 classifier 需要 semantic\\\n    \\ representations 而非纯 surface features。\\nPaper 中作为 §7 Discussion 的一段或 Appendix\\\n    \\ B，不列为 main contribution。\\n连线 Chantree et al. (2006): \\\"Our PoC achieves comparable\\\n    \\ precision (0.81 vs ~0.80) \\nwith substantially less training data, suggesting\\\n    \\ modern PLMs can bootstrap from small \\nannotated datasets for ambiguity detection.\\\"\"\n","numLines":1003,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1003}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GVkbAJvcX59rPPAVb8mJ3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full PDF (10 pages) and the review context YAML. Let me now dispatch a single reviewer for the simple mode review.\n\nLet me analyze the paper thoroughly before dispatching to the reviewer.\n\nThe paper studies how policy ambiguity causes safety violations in LLM agents. Key claims:\n- C1: +28.7pp binary effect (ambiguity → violations), net +21.5pp after perturbation control\n- C2: Three-tier type hierarchy (incompleteness > mid-tier cluster > coreferential)\n- C3: Layer effect (spec > ling) — reported as \"suggestive tendency\" in Discussion\n\n\n- C4: Model×type interaction with substantial variation across models, particularly in auth_scope\n- C5: Type-specific failure modes and notably low awareness of ambiguity effects at 9.2%\n\nNow I'm checking the experimental coverage against the review context. The paper covers the full study on clause generation with 300 pairs and the API study with 1,800 episodes across three models, but I don't see explicit mention of the mini pilot or the full opensource study results.\n\nLooking through the remaining experiments: the statistical analysis, error traces, inter-rater reliability, DRIP-R validation, human judgment calibration, and perturbation controls all appear in the paper sections, though I need to verify the classifier proof-of-concept is actually documented.\n\nNow I'm ready to dispatch a single comprehensive reviewer who can assess the entire study at once, skipping the cross-review and convergence steps as instructed, then I'll compile the final report myself.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48057,"cache_read_input_tokens":25176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48057},"output_tokens":25,"s